return ['domain'=>'page-builder-sandwich','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'page-builder-sandwich','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T05:23:24+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T05:23:24+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Page Builder Sandwich','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/page-builder-sandwich'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/page-builder-sandwich','The foundation release of the rebuilt Page Builder Sandwich: a settings and About screen, a footprint-free front-end output layer, and one sample content block.'=>'Toleo la msingi la Page Builder Sandwich iliyojengwa upya: skrini ya mipangilio na Kuhusu, safu ya pato la mbele isiyo na alama za SEO, na kizuizi kimoja cha maudhui ya sampuli.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Zinn Digital® answered, but not with a connection this plugin understands. Nothing was saved.'=>'Zinn Digital® ilijibu, lakini si kwa muunganisho ambao programu-jalizi hii inaelewa. Hakuna kilichohifadhiwa.','This site has forgotten its connection. Zinn Digital® could not be told just now, so support staff will see it as unused until it is removed on their side.'=>'Tovuti hii imesahau muunganisho wake. Zinn Digital® haikuweza kuambiwa kwa sasa, kwa hivyo wafanyakazi wa usaidizi wataiona kama haitumiki hadi iondolewe kwao.','The Zinn Digital® address this site is set to use is not a secure (https) address, so nothing was sent.'=>'Anwani ya Zinn Digital® ambayo tovuti hii imewekwa kutumia si anwani salama (https), kwa hivyo hakuna kilichotumwa.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached from this site. Check that the site can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuwezi kufikiwa kutoka kwenye tovuti hii. Angalia kama tovuti inaweza kufanya miunganisho ya kutoa data, kisha jaribu tena.','This site\'s connection to Zinn Digital® was revoked. Connect it again to continue.'=>'Muunganisho wa tovuti hii na Zinn Digital® umebatilishwa. Iunganishe tena ili uendelee.','Zinn Digital® no longer recognises this site\'s connection. Connect it again to continue.'=>'Zinn Digital® haitambui tena muunganisho wa tovuti hii. Unganisha tena ili uendelee.','Too many requests were sent from this site or address. Wait a little, then try again.'=>'Maombi mengi sana yametumwa kutoka tovuti au anwani hii. Subiri kidogo, kisha jaribu tena.','Zinn Digital® could not accept this request. Check the email address and the message, then try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuweza kukubali ombi hili. Angalia anwani ya barua pepe na ujumbe, kisha jaribu tena.','Zinn Digital® could not handle the request just now. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuweza kushughulikia ombi hilo kwa sasa. Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','The licensing service is not available on this site.'=>'Huduma ya lesoni haipatikani kwenye tovuti hii.','The trial could not be started here. Continue on the trial page instead.'=>'Jaribio halikuweza kuanzishwa hapa. Endelea kwenye ukurasa wa jaribio badala yake.','Pages saved as standard WordPress blocks'=>'Kurasa zilizohifadhiwa kama vizuizi vya kawaida vya WordPress','Sandwich Studio: a full-screen visual editor'=>'Sandwich Studio: kihariri cha kuona cha skrini nzima','Works inside the normal block editor too'=>'Inafanya kazi ndani ya kihariri cha kawaida cha kuzuia pia','Automatic upgrade of old Page Builder Sandwich pages'=>'Uboreshaji otomatiki wa kurasa za zamani za Page Builder Sandwich','Import from Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder and WPBakery'=>'Agiza kutoka kwa Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder na WPBakery','Latest WordPress and PHP, tested every release'=>'WordPress na PHP ya hivi karibuni, iliyojaribiwa kila toleo','Security by design'=>'Usalama tangu mwanzo','Translated into 58 languages, right-to-left ready'=>'Imetafsiriwa katika lugha 58, tayari kwa kuandika