izi wa miradi','Plan, deliver and lead projects with confidence.'=>'Panga, tekeleza na uongoze miradi kwa kujiamini.','Business writing'=>'Uandishi wa kibiashara','Clear emails, reports and proposals.'=>'Safisha barua pepe, ripoti na mapendekezo.','Niche Authority Site'=>'Tovuti ya Mamlaka ya Niche','Start here'=>'Anza hapa','The topics readers ask about most.'=>'Mada ambazo wasomaji huuliza zaidi.','Growing vegetables'=>'Inachochea mboga','Raised beds, soil, sowing calendars and harvests.'=>'Vitanda vilivyoinuliwa, udongo, kalenda za kupanda na mavuno.','Lawn care'=>'Huduma za bustani','Feeding, mowing and fixing patchy grass.'=>'Kulisha, kukata na kutengeneza nyasi zenye madoadoa.','Garden tools'=>'Vyombo vya bustani','What is worth buying and how to look after it.'=>'Nini kinastahili kununuliwa na jinsi ya kukitunza.','Small gardens'=>'Bustani ndogo','Balconies, patios and containers.'=>'Balkoni, patio na vyombo.','Practical guides to home gardening'=>'Miongozo ya vitendo ya bustani ya nyumbani','Straightforward advice on growing vegetables, caring for lawns and choosing the right tools, written by people who garden every weekend.'=>'Ushauri wa moja kwa moja kuhusu kukuza mboga, kutunza nyasi na kuchagua zana zinazofaa, zilizoandikwa na watu wanaofanya bustani kila wikendi.','Read the latest guides'=>'Soma miongozo ya hivi karibuni','About the author'=>'Kuhusu mwandishi','Estate Agency'=>'Wakala wa Majengo','What is your home worth?'=>'Nyumba yako ina thamani gani?','Book a free, no-obligation valuation.'=>'Weka miadi ya ukadiriaji wa bure, bila wajibu.','Book a valuation'=>'Weka nafasi ya thamani','Free valuation'=>'Tathmini ya bure','An agent visits and prices your home.'=>'Wakala hutembelea na kukadiria bei ya nyumba yako.','Launch'=>'Zindua','Photos, floor plan and listing live within days.'=>'Picha, ramani ya sakafu na orodha huwa hewani ndani ya siku chache.','Sold'=>'Imeshauzwa','We negotiate and manage the sale to completion.'=>'Tunajadiliana na kusimamia uuzaji hadi ukamilike.','Bistro'=>'Bistro','Open Tuesday to Sunday'=>'Fungua Jumanne hadi Jumapili','Seasonal cooking, made for sharing'=>'Mapishi ya msimu, yaliyoundwa kwa ajili ya kushirikiwa','Local produce, a wood-fired oven and a wine list chosen by people who love it. Lunch and dinner, six days a week.'=>'Mazao ya kienyeji, oveni ya kuni na orodha ya divai iliyochaguliwa na watu wanaoipenda. Chakula cha mchana na cha jioni, siku sita kwa wiki.','Book a table'=>'Weka nafasi ya meza','See the menu'=>'Tazama menyu','From our kitchen'=>'Kutoka jikoni kwetu','A short menu that changes with the seasons. Ask us about allergies: we are happy to adapt.'=>'Menyu fupi inayobadilika kulingana na misimu. Uliza kuhusu mzio: tunafurahi kurekebisha.','Small plates'=>'Sahani ndogo','Charred flatbreads, cured meats and garden vegetables to start.'=>'Mkate bapa ulioungua, nyama zilizosindikwa na mboga za bustani kama kitafunio.','From the fire'=>'Kutoka kwa moto','Whole fish, aged steaks and roasted vegetables from the wood oven.'=>'Samaki mzima, steaks zilizokomaa na mboga zilizochomwa kutoka kwenye tanuri ya mbao.','Fresh pasta'=>'Pasta safi','Made by hand every morning, served with seasonal sauces.'=>'Inatayarishwa kwa mikono kila asubuhi, ikitolewa pamoja na michuzi ya msimu.','Desserts'=>'Vitindamra','Tarts, ices and a cheese board from local makers.'=>'Tartu, aiskrimu na bodi ya jibini kutoka kwa waundaji wa ndani.','Set lunch'=>'Weka chakula cha mchana','Two or three courses at a fixed price, Tuesday to Friday.'=>'Kozi mbili au tatu kwa bei maalum, Jumanne hadi Ijumaa.','Private dining'=>'Chumba cha kulia chakula cha faragha','A private room for up to 18 guests with a tailored menu.'=>'Chumba maalum cha faragha cha hadi wageni 18 chenye menyu maalum.','SaaS Product'=>'Bidhaa ya SaaS','Is there a free plan?'=>'Je, kuna mpango wa bure?','Yes, free for small teams, and every paid plan starts with a 14-day trial.'=>'Ndiyo, bila malipo kwa timu ndogo, na kila mpango unaolipishwa huanza na jaribio la siku 14.','Can I cancel any time?'=>'Je, ninaweza kusitisha wakati wowote?','Yes. Monthly plans can be cancelled at any time.'=>'Ndiyo. Mipango ya kila mwezi inaweza kusitishwa wakati wowote.','Where is my data stored?'=>'Data zangu zimehifadhiwa wapi?','In secure, encrypted data centres, with daily backups.'=>'Katika vituo vya data salama na vilivyosimbwa, vyenye nakala rudufu za kila siku.','Everything your team needs'=>'Kila kitu kinachohitajika na timu yako','Boards and timelines'=>'Mbao na ratiba','Switch between kanban boards and timelines in one click.'=>'Badili kati ya mbao za kanban na ratiba kwa mbofyo mmoja.','Automations'=>'Otomatiki','Move tasks, assign owners and send reminders automatically.'=>'Hamisha majukumu, kabidhi wamiliki na utume vikumbusho kiotomatiki.','Shared files'=>'Faili zilizoshirikiwa','Keep documents next to the work they belong to.'=>'Weka nyaraka karibu na kazi zinazohusika nazo.','Reports'=>'Ripoti','Live dashboards for workload, progress and deadlines.'=>'Dashibodi za moja kwa moja za mzigo wa kazi, maendeleo na makataa.','Integrations'=>'Miunganisho','Connect the email, chat and storage tools you already use.'=>'Unganisha zana za barua pepe, gumzo na hifadhi unazozitumia tayari.','Security'=>'Usalama','Single sign-on, audit logs and encrypted data.'=>'Kuingia mara moja, kumbukumbu za ukaguzi na data iliyosimbwa kwa njia fiche.','14-day free trial, no card needed'=>'Jaribio la bure la siku 14, hakuna kadi inayohitajika','Plan projects, not spreadsheets'=>'Panga miradi, si lahajedwali','One workspace for tasks, deadlines and files. Your team sees what matters today, and you see progress without asking for updates.'=>'Nafasi moja ya kazi, tarehe za mwisho na faili. Timu yako inaona mambo muhimu leo, na wewe unaona maendeleo bila kuuliza taarifa mpya.','Start free trial'=>'Anzisha jaribio la bure','See features'=>'Tazama vipengele','Up and running in minutes'=>'Imekwisha simikwa na inafanya kazi kwa dakika chache','Create a workspace'=>'Unda eneo la kazi','Sign up and invite your team in minutes.'=>'Jisajili na ukaribishe timu yako kwa dakika chache.','Import your work'=>'Agiza kazi yako','Bring tasks in from a spreadsheet or another tool.'=>'Leta kazi kutoka kwenye lahajedwali au zana nyingine.','Get moving'=>'Anza sasa','Templates and automations do the busywork.'=>'Violezo na automations hufanya kazi za kuchosha.','You are not allowed to edit this item.'=>'Huruhusiwi kuhariri kipengele hiki.','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Huruhusu kufanya hivi.','Safe mode was turned off because it no longer matches your login. Reload the page.'=>'Hali salama imezimwa kwa sababu hailingani tena na kuingia kwako. Pakia upya ukurasa.','Only an administrator can use safe mode.'=>'Ni msimamizi pekee anayeweza kutumia hali salama.','Safe mode needs a normal browser login.'=>'Hali salama inahitaji kuingia kwenye kivinjari cha kawaida.','Safe mode could not be set up.'=>'Hali salama haikuweza kusanidiwa.','Safe mode needs write access to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Hali salama inahitaji idhini ya kuandika kwenye folda ya wp-content/mu-plugins.','Safe mode could not write to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Hali salama haikuweza kuandika kwenye folda ya wp-content/mu-plugins.','Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio','That page does not exist, or it has been deleted.'=>'Ukurasa huo haupo, au umefutwa.','Sandwich Studio works with the block editor, and the block editor is switched off for this item. A plugin such as Classic Editor does that: allow the block editor for this item in its settings (Settings → Writing), then open Sandwich Studio again.'=>'Sandwich Studio inafanya kazi na kihariri cha vizuizi, na kihariri cha vizuizi kimezimwa kwa kipengele hiki. Programu-jalizi kama vile Classic Editor hufanya hivyo: ruhusu kihariri cha vizuizi kwa kipengele hiki katika mipangilio yake (Mipangilio → Kuandika), kisha ufungue Sandwich Studio tena.','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit this item in Sandwich Studio.'=>'Samahani, huruhusiwi kuhariri kipengele hiki katika Sandwich Studio.','Sandwich Studio is not built. Reinstall the plugin.'=>'Sandwich Studio haijajengwa. Sakinisha tena programu-jalizi.','Add title'=>'Ongeza kichwa','Type / to choose a block'=>'Andika / ili kuchagua kizuizi','Loading Sandwich Studio…'=>'Inapakia Sandwich Studio…','Sandwich Studio needs JavaScript. Use the normal editor instead.'=>'Sandwich Studio inahitaji JavaScript. Tumia kihariri cha kawaida badala yake.','Edit “%s” with Sandwich Studio'=>'Hariri “%s” ukitumia Sandwich Studio','Edit with Sandwich Studio'=>'Hariri kwa Sandwich Studio','Blank canvas'=>'Turubai tupu','Skip to content'=>'Ruka hadi maudhui','The tablet width must be a whole number of pixels from 480 to 2560.'=>'Upana wa kompyuta kibao lazima uwe nambari kamili ya saizi kutoka 480 hadi 2560.','The mobile width must be a whole number of pixels, at least 240 and smaller than the tablet width.'=>'Upana wa simu ya mkononi lazima uwe namba kamili ya saizi (pixels), angalau 240 na mdogo kuliko upana wa kompyuta kibao.','Each custom breakpoint needs its own id: 2 to 12 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kila sehemu maalum ya mapumziko inahitaji kitambulisho chake: herufi ndogo 2 hadi 12 au nambari, zinazoanza na herufi.','A custom breakpoint applies either up to a width (200 to 4000 pixels) or from a width (200 to 6000 pixels), not both.'=>'Sehemu maalum ya kukata inatumika ama hadi upana fulani (kutoka pikseli 200 hadi 4000) au kuanzia upana fulani (kutoka pikseli 200 hadi 6000), lakini sio zote mbili.','Tablet'=>'Kompyuta kibao','Mobile'=>'Simu ya mkononi','Site design'=>'Muundo wa tovuti','Colours, fonts and styles shared by every page of the site and by your theme.'=>'Rangi, fonti na mitindo inayoshirikiwa na kila ukurasa wa tovuti na na mandhari yako.','The site\'s global styles could not be opened.'=>'Mitindo ya jumla ya tovuti haikuweza kufunguliwa.','That font is not one of the site\'s fonts.'=>'Fonti hiyo si mojawapo ya fonti za tovuti.','Each colour needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Kila rangi inahitaji jina la kipekee linaloundwa na herufi ndogo, namba na vistari.','The colour "%s" is not a valid CSS colour.'=>'Rangi "%s" si rangi halali ya CSS.','Each font needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Kila fonti inahitaji jina la kipekee linaloundwa na herufi ndogo, nambari na vitenganishi.','The font stack for "%s" may contain only font names, quotes, commas and spaces.'=>'Lundo la fonti la "%s" linaweza kuwa na majina ya fonti pekee, alama za kunukuu, koma na nafasi.','Uploaded icons'=>'Aikoni zilizopakiwa','Icon'=>'Ikoni','This file is not an SVG icon we can use. It may be damaged, or it only held content that is removed for safety (scripts, links, embedded images or fonts).'=>'Faili hili si ikoni ya SVG tunayoweza kutumia. Huenda limeharibika, au lina maudhui pekee yaliyoondolewa kwa ajili ya usalama (skripti, viungo, picha zilizopachikwa au fonti).','The icon could not be deleted.'=>'Aikoni haikuweza kufutwa.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'ufunguo wa leseni','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Mtumiaji bado hajahusishwa na leseni hiyo, jambo ambalo ni muhimu ili kuzuia uanzishaji usioidhinishwa. Ili kugawa leseni hiyo kwa mtumiaji wako, unakubali kushiriki jina kamili na anwani ya barua pepe ya mtumiaji wako wa WordPress.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'tovuti zilizotajwa hapo juu','Account'=>'Akaunti','Account Details'=>'Maelezo ya Akaunti','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Akaunti inasubiri kuwezeshwa. Tafadhali angalia barua pepe yako na ubofye kiungo ili kuwezesha akaunti yako na kisha utume tena fomu ya washirika.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Je, ungeenda kuunganisha %1$s katika %2$s?','Actions'=>'Vitendo','Activate'=>'Washa','Activate Free Version'=>'Washa Toleo la Bure','Activate License'=>'Washa Leseni','activate a license here'=>'amilisha leseni hapa','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Tafadhali weka ufunguo wa leseni uliopokea kwenye barua pepe mara tu baada ya ununuzi:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Washa lesheni kwenye tovuti zote kwenye mtandao.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Washa leseni kwenye tovuti zote zinazosubiri.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'Toleo la kulipia la %1$s limesakinishwa tayari. Tafadhali liwashe ili uanze kufaidika na vipengele vya %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>'Toleo la kulipia la %1$s limesakinishwa tayari. Tafadhali nenda kwenye %2$s ili kuliwezesha na uanze kufaidika na vipengele vya %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Washa nyongeza hii','Activate %s'=>'Washa %s','Activate %s features'=>'Washa vipengele vya %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Kamilisha Uanzishaji wa "%s" Sasa','Activate %s Plan'=>'Washa Mpango wa %s','Activated'=>'Imewashwa','Activating'=>'Inashtua','Activating license'=>'Inawasha leseni','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'Akaunti yako imeamilishwa kwa mafanikio ukitumia mpango wa %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Amilifu','Add another domain'=>'Ongeza kikoa kingine','Add-Ons'=>'Viongezeo','Add Ons for %s'=>'Viongezao vya %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Hatukuwez