baliwa! Ingia kwenye eneo lako la ushirika katika: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Asante kwa kuomba kujiunga na mpango wetu wa washirika, kwa bahati mbaya, tumeamua kwa sasa kukataa ombi lako. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya siku 30.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Asante kwa kuomba kujiunga na programu yetu ya washirika, tutakagua maelezo yako katika siku 14 zijazo na kukujibu na taarifa zaidi.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'%s kuki ya ufuatiliaji baada ya ziara ya kwanza ili kuongeza uwezo wa mapato.','Affiliation'=>'Ushirika','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Leseni yako ikiisha muda wake bado unaweza kutumia toleo la Bure lakini HUTAPATA fursa ya kutumia vipengele vya %s.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Mara leseni yako itakapokwisha huwezi tena kutumia %s, isipokuwa ukiwasha tena kwa leseni halali ya kulipia.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Bado unaweza kufurahia vipengele vyote vya %1$s lakini hutapata ufikiaji wa usalama wa %2$s na masasisho ya vipengele, wala usaidizi.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Asante kwa kuboresha.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Baada ya majaribio yako ya bure ya %1$s, lipa kiasi kidogo kama %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Kubaliana na Uwashe Leseni','I Agree - Change User'=>'Nakubali - Badilisha Mtumiaji','All Requests'=>'Maombi Yote','All Types'=>'Aina Zote','allow'=>'ruhusu','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Tayari umechagua kushiriki katika ufuatiliaji wetu wa matumizi, jambo ambalo linatusaidia kuendelea kuboresha %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Tayari umejiandikisha katika ufuatiliaji wetu wa matumizi, jambo ambalo linatusaidia kuendelea kuyaboresha.','Amount'=>'Kiasi','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Kila mwaka','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Kila mwaka','Anonymous feedback'=>'Maoni ya siri','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Tumia kwenye tovuti zote kwenye mtandao.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Tumia kwenye tovuti zote zinazosubiri.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Omba kuwa mshirika','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Idhinisha na Anzisha Jaribio','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Tafadhali tuambie sababu ili tuweze kuboresha.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Weka anwani ya barua pepe uliyotumia kwa ajili ya kuboresha hapa chini na tutakutumia tena ufunguo wa leseni.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Weka barua pepe uliyotumia wakati wa ununuzi na tutakutumia tena ufunguo wa leseni.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'Unganisha na akaunti ya mmiliki wa leseni.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Mwandishi','Invalid module ID.'=>'Kitambulisho cha moduli si sahihi.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Huna leseni halali ya kufikia toleo la malipo.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Kujisanja kiotomatiki hufanya kazi tu kwa watumiaji waliojiandikisha.','Premium version already active.'=>'Toleo la kulipia tayari limewashwa.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'Toleo la nyongeza la malipo limesakinishwa tayari.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Programu-jalizi ni "Serviceware" jambo ambalo linamaa