t icon&#x27a4;'=>'&#x27a4;','as synchronizeSync'=>'Sawazisha','Sync Data From Server'=>'Sawazisha Data Kutoka Kwenye Seva','as synchronize licenseSync License'=>'Sawazisha Leseni','Tax / VAT ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha Kodi / VAT','You marked this website, %1$s, as a temporary duplicate of %2$s.'=>'Umeiweka tovouti hii, %1$s, kama nakala ya muda ya %2$s.','You marked this website, %s, as a temporary duplicate of these sites'=>'Ulitiaweka tovuti hii, %s, kama nakala ya muda ya tovuti hizi','Thank you!'=>'Asante!','Thank you so much for using %s!'=>'Asante sana kwa kutumia %s!','Thank you so much for using %s and its add-ons!'=>'Asante sana kwa kutumia %s na viongezi vyake!','Thank you so much for using our products!'=>'Asante sana kwa kutumia bidhaa zetu!','Thanks!'=>'Asante!','Welcome to %s! To get started, please enter your license key:'=>'Karibu kwenye %s! Ili uanze, tafadhali weka ufunguo wao wa leseni:','Thanks, please wait'=>'Asante, tafadhali subiri','Thanks %s!'=>'Asante %s!','The following products\''=>'Bidhaa zifuatazo\'','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.the installation instructions'=>'maagizo ya ufungaji','"The <product_label>", e.g.: "The plugin"The %s\'s'=>'Ya %s','Theme'=>'Mandhari','Theme Switch'=>'Badilisha Mandhari','Themes'=>'Mandhari','Themes page'=>'Ukurasa wa Mandhari','This will allow %s to'=>'Hii itaruhusu %s kuwezesha','Timestamp'=>'Muhuri wa Wakati','Title'=>'Kichwa cha habari','Terms of Service'=>'Masharti ya Huduma','Total'=>'Jumla','Town'=>'Mji','Seems like we are having some temporary issue with your trial cancellation. Please try again in few minutes.'=>'Inaonekana kuna tatizo la muda kidogo katika kughairi jaribio lako. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','Your %s free trial was successfully cancelled.'=>'Jaribio lako la bure la %s limeghairiwa kwa mafanikio.','It looks like you are not in trial mode anymore so there\'s nothing to cancel :)'=>'Inaonekana huko tena katika hali ya majaribio kwa hivyo hakuna cha kusitisha :)','Your free trial has expired. You can still continue using all our free features.'=>'Jaribio lako la bure limekwisha. Bado unaweza kuendelea kutumia vipengele vyetu vyote vya bure.','Your free trial has expired. %1$sUpgrade now%2$s to continue using the %3$s without interruptions.'=>'Jaribio lako la bure limekwisha. %1$sBoresha sasa%2$s ili uendelee kutumia %3$s bila kukatizwa.','Plan %s do not exist, therefore, can\'t start a trial.'=>'Mpango wa %s haupo, kwa hiyo, huwezi kuanza jaribio.','Your trial has been successfully started.'=>'Jaribio lako limeanza kwa mafanikio.','You already utilized a trial before.'=>'Tayari umetumia jaribio hapo awali.','How do you like %1$s so far? Test all our %2$s premium features with a %3$d-day free trial.'=>'Unaipendaje %1$s hadi sasa? Jaribu vipengele vyetu vyote vya kulipia vya %2$s kwa siku %3$d za majaribio ya bure.','Type'=>'Aina','Unable to connect to the filesystem. Please confirm your credentials.'=>'Imeshindikana kuunganisha kwenye mfumo wa faili. Tafadhali thibitisha kitambulisho chako.','There was an unexpected API error while processing your request. Please try again in a few minutes and if it still doesn\'t work, contact the %s\'s author with the following:'=>'Kulikuwa na hitilafu isiyotarajiwa ya API wakati wa kushughulikia ombi lako. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache na ikiwa bado haifanyi kazi, wasiliana na mwandishi wa %s ukiwa na yafuatayo:','Unexpected error, try again in 5 minutes. If the error persists, please contact support.'=>'Hitilafu isiyotarajiwa, jaribu tena baada ya dakika 5. Ikiwa hitilafu itaendelea, tafadhali wasiliana na usaidizi.','Uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Kusanua %s kutazima leseni kiotomatiki, ambayo utaweza kuitumia kwenye tovuti nyingine.','An unknown error has occurred.'=>'Hitilafu isiyojulikana imetokea.','Unlimited commissions.'=>'Tume zisizo na kikomo.','Unlimited Updates'=>'Sasisho Zisizo na Kikomo','verbUpdate'=>'Sasisha','Would you like to proceed with the update?'=>'Je, ungeenda kuendelea na sasisho hili?','Update'=>'Sasisha','Update License'=>'Sasisha Leseni','Upgrade'=>'Boresha','Important Upgrade Notice:'=>'Taarifa Muhimu ya Uboreshaji:','Upload and activate the downloaded version'=>'Pakia na uwashe toleo lililopakuliwa','User Dashboard'=>'Dashibodi ya Mtumiaji','Sorry, we could not complete the email update. Another user with the same email is already registered.'=>'Samahani, hatukuweza kukamilisha usasishaji wa barua pepe. Mtumiaji mwingine mwenye barua pepe hiyo hiyo amesajiliwa tayari.','If you would like to give up the ownership of the %1$s\'s account to %2$s click the Change Ownership button.'=>'Ikiwa ungependa kuhamisha umiliki wa akaunti ya %1$s kwenda kwa %2$s, bofya kitufe cha Badilisha Umiliki.','User ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha Mtumiaji','User key'=>'Ufunguo wa mtumiaji','Users'=>'Watumiaji','Value'=>'Thamani','Verification mail was just sent to %s. If you can\'t find it after 5 min, please check your spam box.'=>'Barua pepe ya uthibitisho imetumwa tu kwa %s. Ikiwa huwezi kuipata baada ya dakika 5, tafadhali angalia folda yako ya taka.','Verified'=>'Imethibitishwa','Verify Email'=>'Thibitisha Barua Pepe','product versionVersion'=>'Toleo','Version %s was released.'=>'Toleo la %s limetolewa.','View details'=>'Tazama maelezo','Click to view full-size screenshot %d'=>'Bofya ili uone picha ya skrini ya ukubwa kamili %d','View paid features'=>'Tazama vipengele vinavyolipishwa','Warning'=>'Onyo','What is your %s?'=>'%s yako ni nini?','Used to express elation, enthusiasm, or triumph (especially in electronic communication).W00t'=>'W00t','WordPress.org Plugin Page'=>'Ukurasa wa Programu-jalizi za WordPress.org','It seems like one of the authentication parameters is wrong. Update your Public Key, Secret Key & User ID, and try again.'=>'Inaonekana mojawapo ya vigezo vya uthibitishaji si sahihi. Sasisha Ufunguo Wako wa Umma, Ufunguo wa Siri na Kitambulisho cha Mtumiaji, kisha ujaribu tena.','%s ago'=>'%s iliyopita','as 5 licenses left%s left'=>'%s imesalia','%s or higher'=>'%s au zaidi','%s\'s paid features'=>'Vipengele vya kulipia vya %s','e.g. Professional Plan%s Plan'=>'Mpango wa %s','%s rating'=>'Ukadiriaji wa %s','%s ratings'=>'ukadiriaji wa %s','%s sec'=>'sekunde %s','%s star'=>'Nyota %s','%s stars'=>'nyota %s','%s time'=>'Muda wa %s','%s times'=>'Mara %s','You have successfully updated your %s.'=>'Umefanikiwa kusasisha %s yako.','as annual periodyear'=>'mwaka','interjection expressing joy or exuberanceYee-haw'=>'Yee-haw','Yes'=>'Ndiyo','You are all good!'=>'Uko sawa kabisa!','You are just one step away - %s'=>'Uko hatua moja tu mbali - %s','Seems like you got the latest release.'=>'Inaonekana umepata toleo jipya zaidi.','You should receive %3$s for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s in the next 5 minutes.'=>'Unapaswa kupokea %3$s ya %1$s kwenye sanduku lako la barua pepe katika %2$s katika dakika 5 zijazo.','ZIP / Postal Code'=>'Msimbo wa Posta',' %1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s ili kufikia toleo la %2$s la usalama na masasisho ya vipengele, na usaidizi.','%1$s automatic security & feature updates and paid functionality will keep working without interruptions until %2$s (or when your license expires, whatever comes first).'=>'Sasisho za kiotomatiki za usalama na vipengele vya %1$s na utendakazi unaolipishwa vitaendelea kufanya kazi bila kukatizwa hadi %2$s (au leseni yako itakapokwisha, chochote kitakachotangulia).','%1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s ili kufikia toleo %2$s la usalama na masasisho ya vipengele, na usaidizi.','API'=>'API','An unknown error has occurred while trying to set the user\'s beta mode.'=>'Kosa lisilojulikana limetokea wakati wa kujaribu kuweka hali ya beta ya mtumiaji.','An unknown error has occurred while trying to toggle the license\'s white-label mode.'=>'Hitilafu isiyojulikana imetokea wakati wa kujaribu kugeuza hali ya lebo nyeupe ya leseni.','Annual'=>'Ya mwaka','By clicking "Opt Out", %s will no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'Kwa kubofya "Opt Out", %s hataweza tena kuona jina lako na barua pepe yako.','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'Kwa kubofya "Jiondoe", data ya uchunguzi haitatum আরও tena kwa %s.','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'Kwa kukata muunganisho wa tovuti hii, data za uchunguzi zilizoshirikiwa awali kuhusu %1$s zitafutwa na hazitaonekana tena kwa %2$s.','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Kwa kujiondoa kushiriki maelezo haya na seva ya masasisho, utalazimika kuangalia matoleo mapya ya %1$s na kuyapakua na kuyasakinisha wewe mwenyewe. Sio tu kwamba ni usumbufu, lakini kukosa sasisho kunaweza kuhatarisha tovuti yako na kusababisha masuala yasiyofaa ya upatanifu, kwa hivyo tunapendekeza sana kuweka ruhusa hizi muhimu zikiwa zimewashwa.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Ghairi %1$s - Sihitaji tena sasisho zama za usalama na vipengele, wala usaidizi wa %2$s kwa sababu sipangi kutumia %3$s kwenye tovuti hii, wala nyingine yoyote.','Cancel %s?'=>'Ghairi %s?','Cancelling %s'=>'Inaghairi %s','Cancelling %s...'=>'Inaghairi %s...','Click here'=>'Bofya hapa','Deactivating'=>'Inazima','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Kutenganisha tovuti kutauondoa kabisa %s kutoka kwa akaunti ya Dashibodi ya Mtumiaji wako.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Kwa ajili ya utoaji wa moja kwa moja wa usalama na masasisho ya vipengele, na usimamizi na ulinzi wa leseni, %s inahitaji:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Kwa ajili ya utoaji wa usalama na sasisho za vipengele, na usimamizi wa leseni, %s inahitaji','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius ni mfumo wetu wa kutoa leseni na kusasisha programu','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Ikiwa hii ni nakala ya muda mrefu, ili kuweka masasisho ya kiotomatiki na utendaji unaolipishwa baada ya %1$s, tafadhali %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'Je, %2$s ni nakala rudufu ya %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Jiunge na Mpango wa Beta','Join the Beta program'=>'Jiunge na mpango wa Beta','License'=>'Leseni','License Key'=>'Kitufe cha Leseni','License key'=>'Ufunguo wa leseni','Monthly'=>'Kila mwezi','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Majida, slug, matoleo, na ikiwa ni amilifu au la','New Version Available'=>'Toleo Jipya Linapatikana','Optional'=>'Si lazima','Plan'=>'Mpango','Products'=>'Bidhaa','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Kushiriki data ya uchunguzi husaidie kutoa utendakazi wa ziada unaofaa kwa tovuti yako, kuepuka kutopatana kwa toleo la WordPress au PHP ambako kunaweza kuvunja tovuti, na kutambua lugha na maeneo ambayo %s inapaswa kutafsiriwa na kulengwa kwayo.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Ili uweze kutumia tena leseni wakati %s haifanyi kazi tena.','Subscription'=>'Usajili','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s itakuwa ikituma mara kwa mara data muhimu ya leseni kwenda %2$s ili kuangalia masasisho ya usalama na vipengele, na kuthibitisha uhalali wa leseni yako.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'Kuna %1$s ya %2$s inayopatikana.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Ili kuhakikisha utangamano na kuepuka migongano na programu jalizi na mandhari zako zilizosakinishwa.','Trial'=>'Jaribio','View %s State'=>'Angalia Hali ya %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Tazama Taarifa za Msingi za %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Ndiyo, %2$s ni nakala rudufu ya %4$s kwa madhumuni ya majaribio, kuandaa, au ukuzaji.','You have a %s license.'=>'Una leseni ya %s.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Umenunua leseni ya %s.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Unapaswa kupokea barua pepe ya uthibitisho ya %1$s katika kisanduku chako cha barua %2$s. Tafadhali hakikisha kuwa unabonyeza kitufe kilicho kwenye barua pepe hiyo ili %3$s.','days'=>'siku','deactivating'=>'inazima','hour'=>'saa','hours'=>'saa','license'=>'leseni','optional'=>'si lazima','products'=>'bidhaa','skip'=>'ruka','subscription'=>'Usajili','trial'=>'jaribio','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Bidhaa','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Inafanya kazi','as software licenseLicense'=>'Leseni','close a windowDismiss'=>'Ondoa','close windowDismiss'=>'Ondoa','like websitesSites'=>'Tovuti','nounPricing'=>'Bei','trial periodTrial'=>'Jaribio','verbOpt In'=>'Jiandikishe','verbOpt Out'=>'Jiondoe','verbSkip'=>'Ruka','verbUpgrade'=>'Boresha','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s iliyopita','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Kitendo hakikuweza kukamilishwa. Jaribu tena, na ikiwa kitaendelea kushindwa, wasiliana msimamizi wa tovuti.','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Thamani inayohitajika inakosekana au ina umbizo lisilo sahihi. Angalia mpango wa ingizo wa uwezo huo.','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Mawakala wa AI (MCP)','Let AI assistants such as Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user with an application password and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Ruhusu visaidizi vya AI kama vile Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor au VS Code vifanyie kazi tovuti hii kupitia MCP (Model Context Protocol). Wanaingia kama mtumiaji wa WordPress aliye na nenosiri la programu na wanaweza kufanya tu kile ambacho mtumiaji huyo anaruhusiwa kufanya.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Mawakala wa AI wanahitaji WordPress 6.9 au toleo jipya zaidi. Sasisha WordPress ili kuwatumia.','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Ruhusu mawakala wa AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Imezimwa: zana zifuatazo na njia zao za REST hazijasajiliwa kabisa.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Anwani ya muunganisho (Sehemu ya mwisho ya MCP)','Create an application password for your user'=>'Undaa nenosiri la programu kwa ajili ya mtumiaji wako','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Ongeza hili kwenye mipangilio ya MCP ya programu yako ya AI, ukitumia jina lako la mtumiaji na nenosiri hilo:','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Zana ambazo wakala wa AI anaweza kutumia hapa (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Mwongozo wa mtumiaji: Mawakala wa AI na MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Nyaraka za waundaji programu: uwezo, REST na MCP','Build and edit this site\'s pages from Page Builder Sandwich sections and website kits.'=>'Jenga na uhariri kurasa za tovuti hii ukitumia sehemu za Page Builder Sandwich na vifaa vya tovuti.','Pages, sections and website kits.'=>'Kurasa, sehemu na vifaa vya tovuti.','List pages'=>'Orodhesha kurasa','Lists the pages you can edit, newest first, with an optional search.'=>'Inaorodhesha kurasa unazoweza kuhariri, mpya kwanza, ikiwa na utafutaji wa hiari.','Words to search for in the title and content.'=>'Maneno ya kutafuta kwenye kichwa na maudhui.','Read a page'=>'Soma ukurasa','Returns a page\'s title, status, links and block content, and the sections (top-level blocks) it is made of.'=>'Inarudisha kichwa cha ukurasa, hali, viungo na maudhui ya kizuizi, pamoja na sehemu (vizuizi vya kiwango cha juu) ambavyo kimeundwa navyo.','Create a page'=>'Undaa ukurasa','Creates a page from sections (see pbs/list-sections) and/or block content. A new page is a draft unless another status is asked for.'=>'Inatengeneza ukurasa kutoka kwa sehemu (tazama pbs/list-sections) na/vau maudhui ya kuzuia. Ukurasa mpya ni rasimu isipokuwa kama hali nyingine itaombwa.','Update a page'=>'Sasisha ukurasa','Changes a page\'s title, status or block content. Content you send replaces the page\'s content.'=>'Inabadilisha kichwa, hali au maudhui ya kizuizi cha ukurasa. Maudhui unayotuma yanachukua nafasi ya maudhui ya ukurasa.','List sections'=>'Orodhesha sehemu','Lists the ready-made sections (hero, features, FAQ, testimonials, call to action and more) that can be added to a page.'=>'Inaorodhesha sehemu zilizotayarishwa tayari (sehemu kuu, vipengele, Maswali Yanayoulizwa Mara kwa Mara, shuhuda, wito wa kuchukua hatua na zaidi) ambazo zinaweza kuongezwa kwenye ukurasa.','Words to match in a section\'s name or keywords.'=>'Maneno ya kulinganisha katika jina au maneno muhimu ya sehemu.','Add a section to a page'=>'Ongeza sehemu kwenye ukurasa','Adds a ready-made section to a page: at the start, at the end, or after the section at a given position.'=>'Inaongeza sehemu iliyotayarishwa tayari kwenye ukurasa: mwanzoni, mwishoni, au baada ya sehemu katika nafasi iliyotolewa.','A section name from pbs/list-sections.'=>'Jina la sehemu kutoka pbs/list-sections.','With position "after": the 0-based position of the section to insert after.'=>'Na nafasi "after": nafasi inayotegemea 0 ya sehemu ya kuingiza baada yake.','List website kits'=>'Orodhesha vifaa vya wavuti','Lists the website kits (a set of ready-made pages for one kind of business) this site can import.'=>'Inaorodhesha vifaa vya tovuti (seti ya kurasa zilizotayarishwa tayari kwa ajili ya aina moja ya biashara) ambavyo tovuti hii inaweza kuagiza.','Import a website kit'=>'Ingiza kifaa cha tovuti','Imports a website kit\'s pages (all of them, or the ones named), optionally publishing them, setting the home page and adding them to a menu. Importing again updates the same pages.'=>'Inaleta kurasa za kifurushi cha tovuti (zote, au zile zilizotajwa), ikizichapisha kwa hiari, kuweka ukurasa wa kwanza na kuziongeza kwenye menyu. Kuleta tena kunasasisha kurasa zilezile.','List the builder blocks'=>'Orodhesha vizuizi vya kijenzi','Lists every Page Builder Sandwich block this site can use (Pro blocks too when Pro is active): name, title, category and description. Use pbs/get-block for a block\'s settings, then put the block in a page\'s content.'=>'Inaorodhesha kila bluu ya Page Builder Sandwich inayoweza kutumiwa na tovuti hii (pamoja na bloku za Pro wakati Pro imewashwa): jina, kichwa, kategoria na maelezo. Tumia pbs/get-block kwa ajili ya mipangilio ya bloku, kisha uweke bloku hiyo katika maudhui ya ukurasa.','Describe a builder block'=>'Eleza kizuizi cha kiunda','Returns one block\'s settings (attributes with their types, choices and defaults), what it supports, which blocks it may contain, and a ready-to-use example in block markup.'=>'Inarejesha mipangilio ya kizuizi kimoja (sifa zilizo na aina zao, chaguo na za msingi), kile kinachounga mkono, vizuizi ambavyo vinaweza kuwa navyo, na mfano ulio tayari kutumika katika uwekaji alama wa kizuizi.','Where the block is: its position among the page\'s sections, then among that block\'s inner blocks, and so on (0-based), as pbs/get-page lists them.'=>'Mahali kilipo kizuizi: nafasi yake miongoni mwa sehemu za ukurasa, kisha miongoni mwa vizuizi vya ndani vya kizuizi hicho, na kadhalika (kuanzia 0), kama inavyoorodheshwa na pbs/get-page.','Change one block\'s settings'=>'Badilisha mipangilio ya kizuizi kimoja','Changes the settings (attributes) of one block inside a page, found by its path; attributes you send are merged over the current ones. Works on blocks the site renders from their settings; for a block whose HTML is saved in the page, send new markup with pbs/update-page.'=>'Inabadilisha mipangilio (sifa) ya kizuizi kimoja ndani ya ukurasa, kinachopatikana kwa njia yake; sifa unazotuma zinajumuishwa juu ya za sasa. Inafanya kazi kwenye vizuizi ambavyo tovuti hutoa kutoka kwa mipangilio yao; kwa kizuizi ambacho HTML yake imehifadhiwa kwenye ukurasa, tuma alama mpya ukitumia pbs/update-page.','Remove a block from a page'=>'Ondoa kizuizi kutoka kwenye ukurasa','Removes one block (a whole section, or a block inside one) from a page, found by its path. The page\'s previous version stays in its revisions.'=>'Huondoa kizuizi kimoja (sehemu nzima, au kizuizi kilicho ndani ya nyingine) kutoka kwenye ukurasa, kilichopatikana kupitia njia yake. Toleo la awali la ukurasa linabaki katika masahihisho yake.','Move a section'=>'Hamisha sehemu','Moves a section of a page from one position to another (0-based, as pbs/get-page lists them).'=>'Inasogeza sehemu ya ukurasa kutoka eneo moja hadi lingine (inayotokana na 0, kama inavyorodheshwa na pbs/get-page).','Duplicate a page'=>'Nakili ukurasa','Copies a page (its title, content and template) into a new draft.'=>'Inanakili ukurasa (kichwa chake, maudhui na kiolezo) hadi kwenye rasimu mpya.','Move a page to the trash'=>'Hamisha ukurasa kwenye tupio','Moves a page to the trash. It can be restored from Pages, Trash for 30 days.'=>'Inahamisha ukurasa hadi kwenye tupio. Inaweza kurejeshwa kutoka Kurasa, Tupio kwa siku 30.','Build a landing page'=>'Tengeneza ukurasa wa kutua','A guided workflow: the agent picks sections that fit your business, builds the page as a draft and writes its text.'=>'Mchakato unaoongozwa: wakala huchagua sehemu zinazofaa biashara yako, hutengeneza ukurasa kama rasimu na kuandika maandishi yake.','The business, its offer and its audience.'=>'Biashara, toleo lake na hadhira yake.','A page can be a draft, pending review, published or private.'=>'Ukurasa unaweza kuwa rasimu, unasubiri ukaguzi, umechappishwa au ni wa faragha.','Give the page a title.'=>'Ipe ukurasa huu kichwa.','%s saves its HTML in the page, so its settings cannot be changed on their own. Send the page\'s new markup with pbs/update-page.'=>'%s inahifadhi HTML yake kwenye ukurasa, kwa hivyo mipangilio yake haiwezi kubadilishwa yenyewe. Tuma msimbo mpya wa ukurasa ukitumia pbs/update-page.','%s (copy)'=>'%s (nakala)','The page could not be moved to the trash.'=>'Kurasa haikuweza kuhamishwa hadi kwenye tupio.','Build a landing page on this WordPress site for: %s. Steps: 1) call pbs-list-sections and choose 4 to 6 sections in a sensible order (hero first, a call to action last); 2) call pbs-create-page with a title and those sections, as a draft; 3) call pbs-get-page and rewrite every piece of placeholder text for this business with pbs-update-page (keep every block comment and tag as it is); 4) if pbs-generate-page is available, you may use it instead of steps 1 to 3; 5) report the page\'s edit link and do not publish it without asking.'=>'Jenga ukurasa wa kutua kwenye tovuti hii ya WordPress kwa ajili ya: %s. Hatua: 1) ita pbs-list-sections na uchague sehemu 4 hadi 6 kwa mpangilio unaofaa (hero kwanza, wito wa kuchukua hatua mwisho); 2) ita pbs-create-page ukiwa na kichwa na sehemu hizo, kama rasimu; 3) ita pbs-get-page na uandike upya kila sehemu ya maandishi ya kishikilia nafasi kwa ajili ya biashara hii kwa pbs-update-page (weka kila maoni ya kizuizi na lebo kama ilivyo); 4) ikiwa pbs-generate-page inapatikana, unaweza kuitumia badala ya hatua 1 hadi 3; 5) ripoti kiungo cha kuhariri cha ukurasa na usichapishe bila kuuliza.','There is no block at that position. Read the page with pbs/get-page first.'=>'Hakuna kizuizi katika eneo hilo. Soma ukurasa ukitumia pbs/get-page kwanza.','There is no block called "%s". See pbs/list-blocks.'=>'Hakuna bluku inayoitwa "%s". Tazama pbs/list-blocks.','The page has no section at that position.'=>'Ukurasa hauna sehemu katika eneo hilo.','That is not a kit name. See pbs/list-kits.'=>'Hilo si jina la kit. Tazama pbs/list-kits.','There is no section called "%s". See pbs/list-sections.'=>'Hakuna sehemu inayoitwa "%s". Tazama pbs/list-sections.','Section names from pbs/list-sections, in page order. They come before any content given.'=>'Majina ya sehemu kutoka pbs/list-sections, kwa mpangilio wa kurasa. Yanakuja kabla ya maudhui yoyote yaliyotolewa.','Block markup (the format the block editor saves).'=>'Alama ya kuzuia (muundo ambao kihariri cha vizuizi huhifadhi).','There is no page with that ID.'=>'Hakuna ukurasa wenye kitambulisho hicho.','You are not allowed to do that to this page.'=>'Huruhusu kufanya hivyo kwenye ukurasa huu.','Connect Adobe Fonts (Pro)'=>'Unganisha Adobe Fonts (Pro)','Connects an Adobe Fonts (Typekit) web project by its kit id, so its fonts appear in the font pickers.'=>'Inaunganisha mradi wa wavuti wa Adobe Fonts (Typekit) kwa kitambulisho chake cha kit (kit id), ili fonti zake zionekane katika vichagua fonti.','Change the brand kit (Pro)'=>'Badilisha kifaa cha chapa (Pro)','Saves the brand kit: name, logo, colours, heading and body fonts, and the brand voice AI writing uses.'=>'Inahifadhi kifurushi cha chapa: jina, nembo, rangi, fonti za vichwa vya habari na za mwili, na sauti ya chapa inayotumiwa na uandishi wa AI.','Apply the brand kit (Pro)'=>'Tumia kifurushi cha chapa (Pro)','Applies the saved brand kit\'s colours and fonts to the site design.'=>'Inatum aplica rangi na fonti za kifurushi cha chapa kilichohifadhiwa kwenye muundo wa tovuti.','Read the responsive breakpoints'=>'Soma sehemu za mapumziko zinazojibu','Returns the tablet and mobile widths (and custom breakpoints in Pro) the responsive controls use.'=>'Inarejesha upana wa kompyuta kibao na simu (na sehemu maalum za kukata katika toleo la Pro) zinazotumiwa na vidhibiti vinavyoitikia.','Change the responsive breakpoints'=>'Badilisha maeneo ya kuvunja yanayoitikia','Changes the tablet and mobile widths in pixels; with Pro, custom extra breakpoints.'=>'Inabadilisha upana wa kompyuta kibao na simu kwa pikseli; ukiwa na Pro, sehemu maalum za kuvunjia.','Create a global class (Pro)'=>'Undaza darasa la kimataifa (Pro)','Creates a reusable global style class: label, slug and its styles (s).'=>'Inaunda darasa la mtindo wa kimataifa linaloweza kutumika tena: lebo, slug na mitindo yake.','Delete a global class (Pro)'=>'Futa darasa la kimataifa (Pro)','Deletes a global class. Elements that used it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'Inafuta darasa la kimataifa. Vipengele vilivyolitumia vinabaki na maudhui yao na hupoteza mitindo yake.','Change a global class (Pro)'=>'Badilisha darasa la kimataifa (Pro)','Changes a global class\'s label, slug or styles; every element using it updates.'=>'Inabadilisha lebo, slug au mitindo ya darasa la kimataifa; kila kipengele kinacholitumia kinasasishwa.','Duplicate a global class (Pro)'=>'Nakili darasa la kimataifa (Pro)','Copies a global class under a new id.'=>'Inakili darasa la kimataifa chini ya kitambulisho kipya.','Turn on an uploaded font (Pro)'=>'Washa fonti iliyopakiwa (Pro)','Makes an uploaded custom font (a font file in the media library, by id) available in the font pickers.'=>'Inafanya fonti maalum iliyopakiwa (faili ya fonti kwenye maktaba ya midia, kwa kitambulisho) ipatikane kwenye vichagua fonti.','Turn off an uploaded font (Pro)'=>'Zima fonti iliyopakiwa (Pro)','Removes a custom font (by slug) from the font pickers.'=>'Huondoa fonti maalum (kwa slug) kutoka kwa vidhibiti vya fonti.','Change dark mode (Pro)'=>'Badili hali ya giza (Pro)','Sets dark mode (mode: off, auto or toggle) and its colours.'=>'Huweka modi ya giza (modi: imezimwa, otomatiki au geuza) na rangi zake.','Read the site design'=>'Soma muundo wa tovuti','Returns the site-wide colours and fonts (heading and body) every block uses, as the Site design screen shows them.'=>'Inarejesha rangi na fonti za tovuti nzima (kichwa na mwili) ambazo kila kizuizi hutumia, kama skrini ya Muundo wa tovuti inavyozionyesha.','Change the site design'=>'Badili muundo wa tovuti','Changes the site-wide colours (colors), fonts (fonts, headingFont, bodyFont). Every page picks the change up; the theme\'s theme.json is kept in sync.'=>'Inabadilisha rangi za tovuti nzima (colors), fonti (fonts, headingFont, bodyFont). Kila ukurasa unachukua mabadiliko hayo; theme.json ya mada inawekwa katika upatanisho.','Read the design system (Pro)'=>'Soma mfumo wa muundo (Pro)','Returns the Pro design system: global classes, variables, design tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts.'=>'Inarudisha mfumo wa muundo wa Pro: madarasa ya kimataifa, vigezo, ishara za muundo, hali ya giza, kifaa cha chapa na fonti maalum.','Change the design tokens (Pro)'=>'Badilisha alama za muundo (Pro)','Changes the spacing, radius and shadow scales (space, radius, shadow), or resets them (reset).'=>'Inabadilisha nafasi, rediasi na mizani ya vivuli (nafasi, rediasi, kivuli), au inaziweka upya (weka upya).','Change the CSS variables (Pro)'=>'Badilisha vigezo vya CSS (Pro)','Replaces the site\'s design variables (variables: a list of name and value).'=>'Inachukua nafasi ya vigezo vya muundo wa tovuti (vigezo: orodha ya jina na thamani).','Remove a self-hosted font'=>'Ondoa fonti inayopangishwa mwenyewe','Deletes a self-hosted font family\'s files.'=>'Inafuta faili za familia ya fonti inayopangishwa mwenyewe.','List self-hosted fonts'=>'Orodhesha fonti zinazojihifadhi','Lists the Google fonts this site hosts itself (downloaded once, served from the site, no request to Google).'=>'Inaorodhesha fonti za Google ambazo tovuti hii inazihifadhi yenyewe (zinapakuliwa mara moja, zinatolewa kutoka kwenye tovuti, hakuna ombi kwa Google).','Self-host a font'=>'Jisimamie fonti','Downloads a Google font family (family, weights, italic) and serves it from this site.'=>'Inapakua familia ya fonti ya Google (family, weights, italic) na kuihudumia kutoka tovuti hii.','List forms'=>'Orodhesha fomu','Lists the forms built with the Form block and the form plugins it can embed.'=>'Inaorodhesha fomu zilizoundwa kwa kutomu ya Fomu na programu jalizi za fomu inayoweza kupachika.','List uploaded icons'=>'Orodhesha aikoni zilizopakiwa','Lists the SVG icons uploaded to the icon library, newest first.'=>'Inaorodhesha aikoni za SVG zilizopakiwa kwenye maktaba ya aikoni, ikianza na mpya zaidi.','Upload an icon'=>'PakIA aikoni','Adds an SVG icon (name, svg markup) to the icon library; the SVG is sanitised first.'=>'Huongeza ikoni ya SVG (jina, alama ya svg) kwenye maktaba ya ikoni; SVG husafishwa kwanza.','Delete an uploaded icon'=>'Futa aikoni iliyopakiwa','Removes an uploaded icon; blocks that used it keep their own copy.'=>'Huondoa ikoni iliyopakiwa; vizuizi vilivyofaa vinadumisha nakala yao wenyewe.','Read the licence'=>'Soma leseni','Returns this site\'s Page Builder Sandwich plan, licence state, renewal date and what the plan includes.'=>'Inarudisha mpango wa Page Builder Sandwich wa tovuti hii, hali ya leseni, tarehe ya kusasisha na kile ambacho mpango huo unajumuisha.','Revoke temporary support logins'=>'Batilisha uingiaji wa usaidizi wa muda','Removes temporary support users now (ids).'=>'Ondoa watumiaji wa usaidizi wa muda sasa (vitambulisho).','List temporary support logins'=>'Orodhesha kuingia kwa usaidizi wa muda','Lists the temporary support users granted to our team and when each expires.'=>'Inaorodhesha watumiaji wa usaidizi wa muda waliotolewa kwa timu yetu na wakati ambapo kila mmoja anaisha muda wake.','Disconnect from support'=>'Tenganisha na usaidizi','Disconnects this site from support.'=>'Inatenganisha tovuti hii na huduma ya usaidizi.','Read the support connection'=>'Soma muunganisho wa usaidizi','Says whether this site is connected to Zinn Digital® support, and as whom.'=>'Inasema kama tovuti hii imeunganishwa na usaidizi wa Zinn Digital®, na kama nani.','Connect to support'=>'Unganisha na huduma kwa wateja','Connects this site to Zinn Digital® support (name, email, consent).'=>'Unganisha tovuti hii na usaidizi wa Zinn Digital® (jina, barua pepe, idhini).','Consent to support diagnostics'=>'Idhinisha utambuzi wa usaidizi','Records the administrator\'s consent to send diagnostics with support tickets.'=>'Inarekodi idhini ya msimamizi ya kutuma vipimo vya uchunguzi pamoja na tiketi za usaidizi.','Read the site diagnostics'=>'Soma uchunguzi wa tovuti','Returns the diagnostics a support ticket would carry: versions, active plugins, limits and recent errors.'=>'Inarejesha taarifa za uchunguzi ambazo tiketi ya usaidizi ingekuwa nazo: matoleo, programu-jalizi zinazotumika, vikomo na hitilafu za hivi karibuni.','Open a support ticket'=>'Fungua tiketi ya usaidizi','Files a support ticket (subject, message, kind, email) with this site\'s diagnostics; access_days and credentials optionally grant our team temporary access.'=>'Inatuma tikiti ya usaidizi (kichwa cha habari, ujumbe, aina, barua pepe) pamoja na uchunguzi wa tovuti hii; access_days na vitambulisho hutoa kwa hiari timu yetu ufikiaji wa muda.','Start the free Pro trial'=>'Anza jaribio la bure la Pro','Starts the 14-day Page Builder Sandwich Pro trial for this site (no payment needed).'=>'Huanzisha jaribio la siku 14 la Page Builder Sandwich Pro kwa tovuti hii (hakuna malipo yanayohitajika).','Read the cloud library account (Pro)'=>'Soma akaunti ya maktaba ya wingu (Pro)','Returns the cloud library\'s storage use, plan quota and team facts.'=>'Inarejesha matumizi ya hifadhi ya maktaba ya wingu, mgao wa mpango na ukweli wa timu.','List cloud library designs (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha miundo ya maktaba ya wingu (Pro)','Lists the designs saved to the cloud library (kind: section, page or pattern; team: a team\'s library).'=>'Inataja miundo iliyohifadhiwa kwenye maktaba ya wingu (aina: sehemu, ukurasa au muundo; timu: maktaba ya timu).','Save a design to the cloud library (Pro)'=>'Hifadhi muundo kwenye maktaba ya wingu (Pro)','Saves block markup (title, kind, markup, styles, tags) to your cloud library or a team\'s; images are packed with it.'=>'Inahifadhi alama za kuzuia (kichwa, aina, alama, mitindo, lebo) kwenye maktaba yako ya wingu au ya timu; picha zimewekwa ndani yake.','Delete a cloud library design (Pro)'=>'Futa muundo wa maktaba ya wingu (Pro)','Deletes a design from the cloud library.'=>'Inafuta muundo kutoka kwa maktaba ya wingu.','Get a cloud library design (Pro)'=>'Pata muundo wa maktaba ya wingu (Pro)','Returns one saved design, ready to insert on this site (its images brought into the media library).'=>'Inarudisha muundo mmoja uliohifadhiwa, tayari kuingizwa kwenye tovuti hii (picha zake zimeletwa kwenye maktaba ya media).','Leave a team (Pro)'=>'Ondoka kwenye timu (Pro)','Leaves the team library this site joined.'=>'Inaondoka kwenye maktaba ya timu ambayo tovuti hii ilijiunga nayo.','Join a team (Pro)'=>'Jiunge na timu (Pro)','Joins a team library with an invite code.'=>'Inajiunga na maktaba ya timu kwa kutumia msimbo wa mwaliko.','Stop using your own storage (Pro)'=>'Acha kutumia hifadhi yako mwenyewe (Pro)','Removes the bring-your-own storage settings; the plan storage is used again.'=>'Huondoa mipangilio ya hifadhi ya kuleta-yako-mwenyewe; hifadhi ya mpango inatumika tena.','Read the own-storage settings (Pro)'=>'Soma mipangilio ya hifadhi ya kibinafsi (Pro)','Returns the bring-your-own R2/S3 storage settings (the secret is never returned).'=>'Inarudisha mipangilio ya hifadhi ya R2/S3 unayojiletea mwenyewe (siri hairejeshwi kamwe).','Use your own storage (Pro)'=>'Tumia hifadhi yako mwenyewe (Pro)','Saves bring-your-own storage: provider (r2 or s3), bucket, region, endpoint, prefix, key_id, secret, enabled.'=>'Inahifadhi hifadhi unayoleta mwenyewe: mtoa huduma (r2 au s3), ndoo, eneo, kituo cha mwisho, kiambishi awali, key_id, siri, imewashwa.','Test your own storage (Pro)'=>'Jaribu hifadhi yako mwenyewe (Pro)','Writes, reads and deletes a test object in your own storage and reports each step.'=>'Huandika, husoma na kufuta kitu cha majaribio kwenye hifadhi yako mwenyewe na kuripoti kila hatua.','List library teams (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha timu za maktaba (Pro)','Lists the teams this site belongs to or owns.'=>'Inaorodhesha timu ambazo tovuti hii inamiliki au inahusika nazo.','Create a library team (Agency)'=>'Unda timu ya maktaba (Wakala)','Creates a team library (name) that other sites can join with an invite code.'=>'Inaunda maktaba ya timu (name) ambayo tovuti zingine zinaweza kujiunga nazo kwa kutumia msimbo wa mwaliko.','Delete a library team (Agency)'=>'Futa timu ya maktaba (Agency)','Deletes a team and every design in its library.'=>'Hufuta timu na kila muundo uliomo kwenye maktaba yake.','Invite a site to a team (Agency)'=>'Alika tovuti kwenye timu (Wakala)','Creates a single-use invite code (role: read or write; label; days valid). The code is shown once.'=>'Inatengeneza nambari ya mwaliko ya mara moja (jukumu: soma au andika; lebo; siku za uhalali). Nambari inaonyeshwa mara moja.','List team members (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha wanachama wa timu (Pro)','Lists the sites in a team and their access.'=>'Orodhesha tovuti zilizoko kwenye timu na ufikiaji wao.','Remove a team member (Agency)'=>'Ondoa mwanachama wa timu (Wakala)','Removes a site from a team.'=>'Inaondoa tovuti kutoka kwenye timu.','List Lottie animations (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha michoro ya Lottie (Pro)','Lists the uploaded Lottie animations.'=>'Inaorodhesha michoro ya Lottie iliyopakiwa.','Upload a Lottie animation (Pro)'=>'Pakia uhuishaji wa Lottie (Pro)','Validates a Lottie JSON document (json, name) and publishes it as a static file for the Lottie block.'=>'Inathibitisha hati ya Lottie JSON (json, name) na kuichapisha kama faili tuli kwa ajili ya kizuizi cha Lottie.','List the A/B tests and their results (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha majaribio ya A/B na matokeo yake (Pro)','Lists the A/B tests with each version\'s visitors and conversions, and which one is winning.'=>'Inaorodhesha majaribio ya A/B pamoja na wageni na waliobadilisha wa kila toleo, na lile linaloshinda.','Create an A/B test (Pro)'=>'Undesha jaribio la A/B (Pro)','Adds a test of two versions of a section to the end of a post (post, name, a, b; split and goal optional).'=>'Huongeza jaribio la matoleo mawili ya sehemu kwenye mwisho wa chapisho (chapisho, jina, a, b; mgawanyiko na lengo si lazima).','Reset an A/B test\'s results (Pro)'=>'Weka upya matokeo ya jaribio la A/B (Pro)','Clears a test\'s counts and starts it again (test).'=>'Hufuta idadi ya jaribio na kulianzisha upya (jaribio).','List the mailing-list connections (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha miunganisho ya orodha ya barua pepe (Pro)','Lists the mailing-list services (Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit, ActiveCampaign) and which are connected. Keys are never returned.'=>'Inaorodhesha huduma za orodha ya barua pepe (Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit, ActiveCampaign) na kubainisha zilizounganishwa. Vifunguo havirudishwi kamwe.','Connect a mailing-list service (Pro)'=>'Unganisha huduma ya orodha ya barua pepe (Pro)','Connects a mailing-list service with its API key (service, key; account where the service needs one), or disconnects it with an empty key.'=>'Inaunganisha huduma ya orodha ya barua pepe na ufunguo wake wa API (huduma, ufunguo; akaunti ambapo huduma inahitaji mmoja), au inaiondoa kwa ufunguo mtupu.','List a service\'s mailing lists (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha orodha za barua pepe za huduma (Pro)','Lists the audiences or lists of a connected mailing-list service, for a form\'s subscribe action.'=>'Orodha za hadhira au orodha za huduma ya barua pepe iliyounganishwa, kwa ajili ya kitendo cha kujiandikisha cha fomu.','Read the cookie consent banner (Pro)'=>'Soma bango la idhini ya kuki (Pro)','Returns the consent banner: whether it is on, its text and design, the categories, and where it applies.'=>'Inarudisha bango la idhini: ikiwa imewashwa, maandishi na muundo wake, kategoria, na mahali linapotumika.','Change the cookie consent banner (Pro)'=>'Badili bendera ya idhini ya kuki (Pro)','Changes the consent banner. While it is on, tracking scripts wait for the visitor\'s consent.'=>'Inabadilisha bango la idhini. Ikiwa imewashwa, hati za ufuatiliaji husubiri idhini ya mgeni.','Create a starter cookie banner (Pro)'=>'Unda bango la vidakuzi vya kuanzia (Pro)','Creates a ready-made consent banner design to start from.'=>'Inaunda muundo wa bango la idhini tayari kwa kuanzia.','List the form-builder forms (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha fomu za mtengenezaji wa fomu (Pro)','Lists every form made with the form builder: the page it is on, its fields and what happens when it is sent.'=>'Inaorodhesha kila fomu iliyoundwa kwa kutumia kijenzi cha fomu: ukurasa iliko, nyanja zake na kile kinachotokea inapowasilishwa.','Create a form (Pro)'=>'Undesha fomu (Pro)','Creates a form (contact, quote, signup or multi-step: fields, steps, settings and actions such as email, save, webhook or a mailing list), on a new page or at the end of an existing post (post).'=>'Inaunda fomu (mawasiliano, nukuu, kujiandikisha au ya hatua nyingi: sehemu, hatua, mipangilio na vitendo kama vile barua pepe, hifadhi, webhook au orodha ya barua pepe), kwenye ukurasa mpya au mwishoni mwa chapisho lililopo (chapisho).','Change a form (Pro)'=>'Badilisha fomu (Pro)','Changes one form (post, form): settings and actions merge with what is there; fields (and steps) replace the fields.'=>'Mabadiliko ya fomu moja (chapisho, fomu): mipangilio na vitendo vinaungana na kile kilichopo; nyanja (na hatua) zinachukua nafasi ya nyanja hizo.','List the animation and interaction settings (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha mipangilio ya uhuishaji na mwingiliano (Pro)','Returns every motion setting (entrance animation, its length and delay, scroll effect, hover effect, stay in view, parallax, follow the pointer) with its choices or range, and the site\'s breakpoints.'=>'Inarudisha kila mpangilio wa mwendo (uhuishaji wa kuingia, urefu na ucheleweshaji wake, athari ya kusogeza, athari ya kuelea, baki kwenye mwonekano, parallax, fuata kielekezi) pamoja na chaguo au safu yake, na sehemu za kukata za tovuti.','Animate a block (Pro)'=>'Huisha kizuizi (Pro)','Sets or removes (null) motion settings on one block of a page, found by its path, at a breakpoint (base by default). Works on any block, including core blocks whose HTML is saved in the page. Visitors who ask for reduced motion never see the movement.'=>'Huweka au huondoa (null) mipangilio ya mwendo kwenye kizuizi kimoja cha ukurasa, kinachopatikana kwa njia yake, katika sehemu ya kukata (ya msingi kwa chaguo-msingi). Hufanya kazi kwenye kizuizi chochote, ikiwa ni pamoja na vizuizi vya msingi ambavyo HTML yake imehifadhiwa kwenye ukurasa. Wageni wanaoomba mwendo uliopunguzwa hawawahi kuona mwendo huo.','List the popups (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha madirisha ibukizi (Pro)','Lists the popups, slide-ins and bars with their triggers, frequency rules and where they show.'=>'Inaorodhesha madirisha ibukizi, slaidi na pau pamoja na vianzishaji vyake, sheria za marudio na mahali panapooonyeshwa.','Create a popup (Pro)'=>'Undua ibukizi (Pro)','Creates a popup, slide-in or bar: its content, trigger (exit intent, scroll, time, click), frequency and the pages it shows on.'=>'Inatengeneza kidukizo, kuteleza ndani au upau: maudhui yake, kichocheo (kusudi la kuondoka, kusogeza, muda, kubofya), marudio na kurasa inazoonekana.','Change a popup (Pro)'=>'Badilisha pop-up (Pro)','Changes a popup, slide-in or bar (id): content, trigger, frequency or where it shows.'=>'Inabadilisha ibukizi, slaidi au mwambaa (id): maudhui, kichocheo, marudio au mahali inapooneshwa.','Read form submissions (Pro)'=>'Soma maombi yaliyowasilishwa (Pro)','Lists what visitors sent through the forms that save submissions (form narrows it), a page at a time.'=>'Orodhesha yale ambayo wageni wametuma kupitia fomu zinazohifadhi mawasilisho (fomu hupunguza chaguo), ukurasa mmoja kwa wakati.','Read the conversion tracking (Pro)'=>'Soma ufuatiliaji wa ubadilishaji (Pro)','Returns the Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager and Meta Pixel settings and which clicks and form submissions are sent.'=>'Inarejesha mipangilio ya Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager na Meta Pixel na kubainisha ni mibofyo na uwasilishaji gani wa fomu unaotumwa.','Change the conversion tracking (Pro)'=>'Badilisha ufuatiliaji wa ubadilishaji (Pro)','Changes the Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager and Meta Pixel settings and which events are sent.'=>'Inabadilisha mipangilio ya Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager na Meta Pixel na ni matukio gani yanayotumwa.','Read the legacy migration'=>'Soma uhamaji wa urithi','Returns the 5.x content conversion\'s progress and report.'=>'Inarudisha maendeleo na ripoti ya ubadilishaji wa maudhui ya 5.x.','Convert legacy content'=>'Badili maudhui ya zamani','Starts (or restarts) converting every 5.x page to blocks; each post is backed up first.'=>'Inaanza (au kuanzisha upya) kubadilisha kila ukurasa wa 5.x kuwa vizuizi; kila chapisho linachelezwa kwanza.','Undo the legacy migration'=>'Tendua uhamiaji wa kurithi','Restores every converted post from its backup.'=>'Inarejesha kila chapisho lililogeuzwa kutoka kwenye nakala rudufu yake.','Read the newsletter connection (Pro)'=>'Soma muunganisho wa jarida (Pro)','Says whether a Mailchimp key is saved (the key itself is never returned).'=>'Inasema ikiwa ufunguo wa Mailchimp umehifadhiwa (ufunguo wenyewe haurudishwi kamwe).','Connect Mailchimp (Pro)'=>'Unganisha Mailchimp (Pro)','Saves (or, with an empty value, removes) the Mailchimp API key the newsletter block uses.'=>'Inahifadhi (au, ikiwa na thamani tupu, inaondoa) ufunguo wa API ya Mailchimp unaotumiwa na kizuizi cha jarida.','Convert one legacy page'=>'Geuza ukurasa mmoja wa zamani','Converts one 5.x page to blocks (backed up first).'=>'Inabadilisha ukurasa mmoja wa 5.x kuwa vizuizi (imehifadhiwa nakala kwanza).','Undo one conversion'=>'Tendua ubadilishaji mmoja','Restores one converted page from its backup.'=>'Inarejesha ukurasa mmoja uliogeuzwa kutoka kwenye nakala rudufu yake.','Read the reviews sources (Pro)'=>'Soma vyanzo vya hakiki (Pro)','Returns the Google and Trustpilot sources the Reviews block shows.'=>'Inarudisha vyanzo vya Google na Trustpilot vinavyoonyeshwa na kizuizi cha Ukaguzi.','Change the reviews sources (Pro)'=>'Badili vyanzo vya hakiki (Pro)','Sets the Google place and Trustpilot business the Reviews block reads.'=>'Huweka mahali pa Google na biashara ya Trustpilot inayosomwa na kizuizi cha Reviews.','Refresh reviews now (Pro)'=>'Sasisha maoni sasa (Pro)','Fetches the latest Trustpilot reviews now instead of waiting for the daily refresh.'=>'Inaleta hakiki za hivi punde za Trustpilot sasa badala ya kusubiri usasishaji wa kila siku.','Read the plugin settings'=>'Soma mipangilio ya programu-jalizi','Returns the front-end class prefix, the beta-updates state and whether AI agents (MCP) are allowed.'=>'Inarejesha kiambishi tamati cha darasa la mbele, hali ya masasisho ya beta na iwapo mawakala wa AI (MCP) wanaruhusiwa.','Change the plugin settings'=>'Badilisha mipangilio ya programu-jalizi','Changes the front-end class prefix (1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter) and/or turns AI agents (MCP) on or off (mcp: false removes every ability and the MCP endpoint).'=>'Inabadilisha kiambishi awali cha darasa la mbele (herufi 1 hadi 8 za herufi ndogo au nambari, zinazoanza na herufi) na/au kuwasha au kuzima mawakala wa AI (MCP) (mcp: false inaondoa kila uwezo na sehemu ya mwisho ya MCP).','Export designs and settings'=>'Hamisha miundo na mipangilio','Exports the chosen templates and patterns (ids) and, optionally, settings as one package for another site.'=>'Inasafirisha violezo na ruwaza (vitambulisho) vilivyochaguliwa na, kwa hiari, mipangilio kama kifurushi kimoja kwa tovuti nyingine.','Import designs and settings'=>'Ingiza miundo na mipangilio','Imports a package made by pbs/export-designs (dryRun first to see what would change; mode: skip or replace; media; settings).'=>'Inapokea kifurushi kilichotengenezwa na pbs/export-designs (dryRun kwanza ili kuona kitakachobadilika; mode: skip au replace; media; settings).','List what can be exported'=>'Orodhesha kile kinachoweza kusafirishwa nje','Lists the templates, patterns and settings that can be exported to another site.'=>'Inaorodhesha violezo, miundo na mipangilio inayoweza kuhamishwa hadi kwenye tovuti nyingine.','Read maintenance mode (Pro)'=>'Soma hali ya matengenezo (Pro)','Returns maintenance / coming-soon mode: mode, page, retry-after and which roles still see the site.'=>'Inarejesha hali ya matengenezo / hali ya inakuja hivi karibuni: hali, ukurasa, jaribu tena baadaye na ni majukumu gani bado yanaona tovuti.','Change maintenance mode (Pro)'=>'Badilisha hali ya matengenezo (Pro)','Turns maintenance (503) or coming-soon mode on or off (mode), with the page to show (page_id), retry_after and the roles that bypass it.'=>'Inawasha au kuzima hali ya matengenezo (503) au hali ya kuja hivi karibuni (mode), ikiwa na ukurasa wa kuonyesha (page_id), retry_after na majukumu yanayoipita.','List find-and-replace jobs (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha kazi za kutafuta na kubadilisha (Pro)','Lists the site-wide find-and-replace jobs and their state.'=>'Inaorodhesha kazi za kutafuta-na-kubadilisha za tovuti nzima na hali yake.','Find and replace across the site (Pro)'=>'Tafuta na ubadilishe kwenye tovuti nzima (Pro)','Starts a block-safe find-and-replace (find, replace, kind: text, link or colour; match_case; types). Nothing changes until pbs/apply-replace.'=>'Inaanza utafutaji na ubadilishaji salama wa kuzuia (tafuta, badilisha, aina: maandishi, kiungo au rangi; match_case; aina). Hakuna kinachobadilika hadi pbs/apply-replace.','Preview a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Hakiki utafutaji na ubadilishaji (Pro)','Returns a job\'s matches, page by page, to review before applying.'=>'Inarejesha ulinganifu wa kazi, ukurasa baada ya ukurasa, ili kukagua kabla ya kutuma maombi.','Apply a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Tumia utafute-na-ubadilishe (Pro)','Applies a previewed job. Every changed post keeps a backup for pbs/undo-replace.'=>'Inatumika kwa kazi iliyohakikiwa mapema. Kila chapisho lililobadilishwa huweka nakala rudufu kwa pbs/undo-replace.','Undo a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Tendua utafute-na-ubadilishe (Pro)','Restores the posts a job changed (a post edited since keeps its edit).'=>'Inarudisha machapisho yaliyobadilishwa na kazi (chapisho lililohaririwa tangu wakati huo linadumisha mabadiliko yake).','Read builder permissions (Pro)'=>'Soma ruhusa za kijenzi (Pro)','Returns which roles may use the builder, design, code and templates (client mode).'=>'Inarudisha majukumu yanayoweza kutumia kiteuzi, muundo, msimbo na vigempu (hali ya mteja).','Change builder permissions (Pro)'=>'Badilisha ruhusa za kijenzi (Pro)','Sets per role what the builder allows (roles), e.g. a content-only client role.'=>'Weka kwa kila jukumu kile ambacho mtengenezaji anaruhusu (majukumu), kwa mfano, jukumu la mteja wa maudhui pekee.','Read white label (Agency)'=>'Soma lebo nyeupe (Wakala)','Returns the white-label settings: on or off, the name shown and which users still see the original.'=>'Inarudisha mipangilio ya lebo-nyeupe: imewashwa au imezimwa, jina linaloonyeshwa na watumiaji gani bado wanaona asili.','Change white label (Agency)'=>'Badilisha lebo nyeupe (Wakala)','Turns white label on or off and sets the name clients see (enabled, name, agency_users).'=>'Inawasha au Inazima lebo nyeupe na kuweka jina ambalo wateja huliona (enabled, name, agency_users).','Build several pages'=>'Jenga kurasa kadhaa','Creates up to 50 pages in one call, each from sections and/or block content. Each page is checked and created on its own; the answer lists every page made and every one refused, with the reason.'=>'Hutengeneza kurasa hadi 50 kwa simu moja, kila moja ikiwa na sehemu na/au maudhui ya kizuizi. Kila ukurasa hukaguliwa na kuundwa kivyake; jibu linaorodhesha kila ukurasa ulioundwa na kila uliokataliwa, pamoja na sababu.','Write a page with AI'=>'Andika ukurasa ukitumia AI','Builds a page from sections (given, or chosen by AI from the section library) and has AI rewrite all of its text for your brief, keeping the design. Uses the AI provider set up in the plugin\'s AI settings. The page is a draft unless another status is asked for.'=>'Huunda ukurasa kutoka kwa sehemu (zilizotolewa, au zilizochaguliwa na AI kutoka kwa maktaba ya sehemu) na ina AI kuandika upya maandishi yake yote kwa ajili ya muhtasari wako, huku ikidumisha muundo. Inatumia mtoa huduma wa AI aliyewekwa katika mipangilio ya AI ya programu-jalizi. Ukurasa huu ni rasimu isipokuwa kama hali nyingine itaombwa.','What the page is for: the business, the offer, the audience and the tone.'=>'Madhumuni ya ukurasa: biashara, toleo, hadhira na mtindo.','Send between 1 and %d pages.'=>'Tuma kati ya kurasa 1 na %d.','AI is not available in this build.'=>'AI haipatikani katika toleo hili.','Describe the page in at least a sentence.'=>'Eleza ukurasa kwa angalau sentensi moja.','The AI did not choose any section from the library. Name the sections yourself, or try a more detailed brief.'=>'AI haijachagua sehemu yoyote kutoka kwa maktaba. Taja sehemu hizo wewe mwenyewe, au jaribu muhtasari wenye maelezo zaidi.','The AI rewrote %1$d of the page\'s %2$d pieces of text, so nothing was saved. Try again.'=>'AI imepitia upya sehemu %1$d kati ya sehemu %2$d za maandishi ya ukurasa huu, kwa hiyo hakuna kilichohifadhiwa. Jaribu tena.','The AI request failed. Try again.'=>'Ombi la AI limeshindwa. Jaribu tena.','A migration step is running right now. Try again in a minute.'=>'Hatua ya kuhamisha data inaendelea sasa hivi. Jaribu tena baada ya dakika moja.','Rated %s out of 5'=>'Imepimwa %s kati ya 5','Adults only: %d and over'=>'Watu wazima pekee: %d na zaidi','Pros'=>'Faida','Cons'=>'Hasara','%1$s out of %2$s'=>'%1$s kati ya %2$s','Claim offer'=>'Dai offeri','New customers only. Terms and conditions apply.'=>'Wateja wapya pekee. Sheria na masharti zinatumika.','Rank'=>'Nafasi','Operator'=>'Mwendeshaji','Bonus'=>'Bonasi','Rating'=>'Ukadiriaji','Highlights'=>'Mambo Muhimu','Visit'=>'Tembelea','New customers only. Terms and conditions apply. Please gamble responsibly.'=>'Wateja wapya pekee. Sheria na masharti zinatumika. Tafadhali cheza kamari kwa uwajibikaji.','%s in 24 hours'=>'%s baada ya saa 24','Prices will appear here shortly.'=>'Bei zitaonekana hapa hivi karibuni.','Prices from CoinGecko, updated %s'=>'Bei kutoka CoinGecko, zimesasishwa %s','Cryptocurrency prices'=>'Bei za sarafu za mtandaoni','%1$s: %2$s, up %3$s%% in %4$d day'=>'%1$s: %2$s, imepanda kwa %3$s%% katika siku %4$d' . "\0" . '%1$s: %2$s, imeongezeka kwa %3$s%% katika siku %4$d','%1$s: %2$s, down %3$s%% in %4$d day'=>'%1$s: %2$s, imeshuka kwa asilimia %3$s%% katika siku %4$d' . "\0" . '%1$s: %2$s, imeshuka kwa asilimia %3$s%% ndani ya siku %4$d','Lowest'=>'Ya chini kabisa','Highest'=>'Ya Juu Zaidi','Latest'=>'Mpya zaidi','Are you %d or older?'=>'Je, una umri wa miaka %d au zaidi?','This website is for adults only. Please confirm your age to continue.'=>'Tovuti hii ni kwa ajili ya watu wazima pekee. Tafadhali thibitisha umri wako ili uendelee.','Sorry, you must be %d or older to visit this website.'=>'Samahani, lazima uwe na umri wa miaka %d au zaidi ili kutembelea tovuti hii.','Sorry, this website is not available in your country.'=>'Samahani, tovuti hii haipatikani katika nchi yako.','Your date of birth'=>'Tarehe y