That could not be saved.'=>'Haiikuweza kuhifadhiwa.','Before you contact support'=>'Kabla ya kuwasiliana na usaidizi','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'Ombi lako limetum kutoka tovuti hii kwenda kwa %s, ambao ndio watengenezaji wa programu-jalizi hii. Tunatuma:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'barua pepe yako na jina lako, ili tuweze kukujibu;','the subject and message you write;'=>'mada na ujumbe unaoandika;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'kitambulisho chako cha leseni, ili wateja wanaolipa wapate kipaumbele;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'ikiwa tu utaiweka alama ya vema: maelezo ya tovuti (matoleo ya WordPress na PHP, mandhari, programu-jalizi, dondoo la kumbukumbu ya makosa na nenosiri na anwani za barua pepe zimeondolewa), ambayo unaweza kusoma kabla ya kutuma;','only if you add them: logins for your site, stored encrypted and deleted 30 days after your request is closed.'=>'ikiwa tu utaziongeza: maelezo ya kuingia kwenye tovuti yako, yaliyohifadhiwa kwa njia ya usimbaji fiche na kufutwa siku 30 baada ya ombi lako kufungwa.','I agree, continue'=>'Nakubali, endelea','The connection could not be checked.'=>'Uunganisho haukuweza kuangaliwa.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Haikufanya kazi. Jaribu tena.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn Digital® umekata muunganisho wa tovuti hii.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn Digital® hautambui tena tovuti hii.','You disconnected this site.'=>'Umeondoa muunganisho wa tovuti hii.','Connect this site to support'=>'Unganisha tovuti hii na usaidizi','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'Imeunganishwa. Majibu yanakwenda kwa %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Hujaunganishwa. Bado unaweza kutuma ombi ukitumia anwani yako ya barua pepe hapa chini; kuunganishwa kunaokoa muda wa kuiandika kila wakati.','E-mail address'=>'Anwani ya barua pepe','Your name (optional)'=>'Jina lako (si lazima)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Nakubali kuunganisha tovuti hii na msaada wa Zinn Digital®. Hatua hii inatuma anwani ya tovuti hii, matoleo ya WordPress na PHP na toleo la programu-jalizi, na inaweza kukatishwa wakati wowote kutoka hapa au na Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'Unganisha','I need help'=>'Ninahitaji msaada','Report a bug'=>'Ripoti mdudu','Send feedback'=>'Tuma maoni','Request a feature'=>'Omba kipengele','The site details could not be read.'=>'Maelezo ya tovuti hayakuweza kusomwa.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ombi halikuweza kutumwa. Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','WordPress admin'=>'Utawala wa WordPress','File manager'=>'Kidhibiti cha faili','cPanel'=>'cPanel','FTP / SFTP'=>'FTP / SFTP','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Maoni na maombi ya vipengele','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'Imetumwa. Rejeleo lako ni %s, na jibu letu litakuja kupitia barua pepe.','What is it about?'=>'Inahusu nini?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'Jibu kwa (barua pepe)','Subject'=>'Mada','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Ulifanya nini, ulitarajia nini, na badala yake nini kilitokea?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Jumuisha maelezo ya tovuti (matoleo, mandhari, programu-jalizi, dondoo la logi ya makosa)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Ona kile kinachotumwa haswa','Loading…'=>'Inapakia…','Logins for support (optional, stored encrypted)'=>'Taarifa za kuingia kwa ajili ya usaidizi (si lazima, zinahifadhiwa zimesimbwa kwa njia fiche)','A login is only sent with its password. Leave a row out rather than half-filled.'=>'Kuingia hutum moléculas na nenosiri lake pekee. Afadhali uache safu wazi kuliko kuijaza nusu.','Login address'=>'Anwani ya kuingia','Add a login'=>'Ongeza kuingia kwenye mfumo','Create a temporary support login'=>'Undha kuingia kwa usaidizi wa muda','A separate user for our support team, without access to users, plugins installation or code editing. It is deleted automatically when it expires, or whenever you revoke it below.'=>'Mtumiaji tofauti kwa ajili ya timu yetu ya usaidizi, bila ufikiaji wa watumiaji, usakinishaji wa programu jalizi au uhariri wa nambari ya programu. Inafutwa kiotomatiki muda wake ukiisha, au wakati wowote utakapoi batilisha hapa chini.','Yes, for %d day'=>'Ndiyo, kwa siku %d' . "\0" . 'Ndiyo, kwa siku %d','The list could not be loaded.'=>'Orodha haikuweza kupakiwa.','That login could not be removed.'=>'Kuingia huko hakuwezi kuondolewa.','Temporary support logins'=>'Ingia za usaidizi za muda','None. Support can only log in to this site if you create a login here.'=>'Hakuna. Usaidizi unaweza kuingia kwenye tovuti hii tu ikiwa utatengeneza utambulisho wa kuingia hapa.','expired, being removed'=>'muda wake umekwisha, inaondolewa','expires %s'=>'inaisha muda %s','Revoke now'=>'Batilisha sasa','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Hatua ya %1$d ya %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Funga ziara','Everything in one place'=>'Kila kitu mahali pamoja','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Tepe hizi zinaelekeza kwenye kila skrini ya programu-jalizi: usanidi, mipangilio, leseni yako, msaada na mengineyo.','Help on every screen'=>'Msaada katika kila skrini','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Fungua menyu hii kwa ajili ya mwongozo wa skrini uliyomo, ziara hii, au ili kutuomba msaada.','Light or dark'=>'Mwanga au giza','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Chagua mwanga, giza, au sawa na kompyuta yako. Chaguo lako linakumbukwa kwa ajili yako pekee.','Welcome'=>'Karibu','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Ziara hii fupi inaonyesha vitu viko wapi. Unaweza kuondoka wakati wowote kwa kubonyeza Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Mtandao wako kwa mtazamo mmoja','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Maendeleo ya usanidi na mpango wako vinaonyeshwa hapa, pamoja na jambo linalofuata linalofaa kufanywa.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Mpango wako, idadi ya tovuti inazofunika, na ikiwa nakala hii ya tovuti inahesabika kwa kikomo hicho.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Jaribu Pro au boresha','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Anza jaribio la bure bila kadi, boresha, au sasisha, yote kutoka hapa.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Kila kipengele na mpango unaojumuisha. Tafuta kipengele au uonyeshe eneo moja kwa wakati mmoja.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Zaidi kutoka Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Programu-jalizi zinazofanya kazi na hii, na huduma kutoka kwa timu hiyo hiyo. Kadi ulizoficha kwenye skrini zingine zinaweza kuonyeshwa tena hapa.','Connect for faster help'=>'Unganisha kwa usaidizi wa haraka','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Kuunganisha si lazima. Inakuwezesha kutuma maombi bila kuandika barua pepe yako kila wakati, na unaweza kukata muunganisho wakati wowote upendao.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Omba msaada au ripoti mdudu','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Eleza kilichotokea. Unachagua kama ungependa kuambatisha maelezo ya tovuti, na unaweza kuona hasa kile kilicho ndani yake kwanza.','Temporary support access'=>'Upatikanaji wa usaidizi wa muda','If support needs to look inside your site, create a temporary login here. It deletes itself when it expires, and you can remove it at any time.'=>'Ikiwa usaidizi unahitaji kuangalia ndani ya tovuti yako, unda kuingia kwa muda hapa. Kujifuta yenyewe inapokwisha muda wake, na unaweza kuiondoa wakati wowote.','Tell us what to build'=>'Tuambie nini cha kujenga','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'Tuma wazo, ombi la kipengele au maoni yoyote. Inakwenda moja kwa moja kwa timu.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Hii inachukua dakika chache na inaweka %s ili ifanye kazi kwenye tovuti hii mara moja. Unaweza kubadilisha kila kitu baadaye.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'Uko tayari. Ikiwa kitu chochote hakifanyi kazi kama inavyotarajiwa, tuko mbali kwa mbofyo mmoja.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Hatua ya %1$d kati ya %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Maliza','Skip setup'=>'Ruka usanidi','Import “%s”'=>'Ingiza “%s”','%d page imported.'=>'Kurasa %d zimeingizwa.' . "\0" . 'Kurasa %d zimeingizwa.','edit'=>'hariri','Pages to import'=>'Kurasa za kuagiza','Publish the pages now (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Chapisha kurasa sasa (vinginevyo zimehifadhiwa kama rasimu)','Use the kit’s home page as the site’s front page'=>'Tumia ukurasa wa nyumbani wa kisanduku hiki kama ukurasa wa mbele wa tovuti','Create a menu with the imported pages'=>'Undaa menyu ukitumia kurasa zilizoingizwa','Importing never changes your existing pages. Importing the same kit again updates the pages it created before.'=>'Kuingiza hakubadili kurasa zako zilizopo. Kuingiza kit hicho hicho tena kunasasisha kurasa zilizoundwa hapo awali.','Import'=>'Leta','Complete websites you can import in one click: pages, sections and a menu, ready for your own words and pictures. Kits come from Zinn Digital® and new ones are added every month.'=>'Tovuti kamili unazoweza kuleta kwa kubofya mara moja: kurasa, sehemu na menyu, tayari kwa maneno na picha zako mwenyewe. Vifaa vinatoka Zinn Digital® na vipya vinaongezwa kila mwezi.','Search kits'=>'Tafuta vifaa','Category'=>'Kategoria','All categories'=>'Makundi yote','Free and Pro'=>'Bure na Pro','Go Pro to import'=>'Nenda Pro ili uingize','No kit matches these filters.'=>'Hakuna kifaa kinacholingana na vichujio hivi.','My library'=>'Maktaba yangu','Team'=>'Timu','Storage'=>'Hifadhi','Your library is kept in your own storage bucket, so no Zinn Digital® quota applies.'=>'Maktaba yako imehifadhiwa kwenye pipa lako mwenyewe la hifadhi, kwa hiyo hakuna kiwango cha upendeleo cha Zinn Digital® kinachotumika.','%1$s of %2$s used (%3$d%%)'=>'%1$s kati ya %2$s zilizotumika (%3$d%%)','%1$d of %2$d designs · up to %3$s per design · images are resized to 2560 px and stored once'=>'Miundo %1$d kati ya %2$d · hadi %3$s kwa kila muundo · picha hubadilishwa ukubwa kuwa px 2560 na kuhifadhiwa mara moja','Deleted from your library.'=>'Imefutwa kwenye maktaba yako.','Save any section or page from the editor: open the block’s ⋮ menu and choose “Save to cloud library”. Insert saved designs from the Cloud library panel in the editor, on any of your sites.'=>'Hifadhi sehemu au ukurasa wowote kutoka kwa kihariri: fungua menyu ya ⋮ ya kizuizi na uchague "Hifadhi kwenye maktaba ya wingu". Weka miundo iliyohifadhiwa kutoka kwenye paneli ya Maktaba ya wingu katika kihariri, kwenye tovuti yako yoyote.','Show'=>'Onyesha','Everything'=>'Kila kitu','Sections'=>'Sehemu','Styles'=>'Mitindo','Size'=>'Ukubwa','Nothing saved yet.'=>'Hakuna kilichohifadhiwa bado.','Delete'=>'Futa','Write a test file'=>'Andika faili ya majaribio','Read it back'=>'Soma tena','Delete it'=>'Ifute','In your Cloudflare dashboard, open R2 Object Storage and create a bucket (for example “my-pbs-library”). Keep it private: do not connect a public domain.'=>'Katika dashibodi yako ya Cloudflare, fungua R2 Object Storage na uunde hifadhi (kwa mfano "my-pbs-library"). Ihifadhi iwe ya faragha: usiunganishe kikoa cha umma.','Open “Manage API tokens” in R2 and create an API token with “Object Read & Write” permission, limited to that one bucket.'=>'Fungua “Manage API tokens” katika R2 na uunde tokeni ya API yenye ruhusa ya “Object Read & Write”, iliyowekewa kikomo kwa ndoo hiyo moja.','Copy the Access Key ID and the Secret Access Key it shows (the secret is shown only once).'=>'Nakili Kitambulisho cha Ufunguo wa Upatikanaji na Ufunguo wa Siri wa Upatikanaji unaoonyeshwa (siri hiyo inaonyeshwa mara moja tu).','Copy the S3 endpoint for your account. It looks like https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Region is “auto”.'=>'Nakili mwisho wa S3 kwa akaunti yako. Inaonekana kama https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Eneo ni “auto”.','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”. Switch the library to your storage only when the test passes.'=>'Bandika thamani zilizo hapa chini, hifadhi, kisha bonyeza “Jaribu muunganisho”. Badilisha maktaba iwe ya hifadhi yako wakati tu jaribio limefaulu.','Create a private bucket with your provider (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO or any S3-compatible service).'=>'Unda ndoo ya faragha ukitumia mtoa huduma wako (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO au huduma yoyote inayooana na S3).','Create an access key that can read, write and delete objects in that bucket only.'=>'Tengeneza ufunguo wa ufikiaji ambao unaweza kusoma, kuandika na kufuta vitu kwenye ndoo hiyo pekee.','Find the S3 endpoint (for Amazon S3: https://s3.<region>.amazonaws.com) and the bucket’s region.'=>'Tafuta enzi-pointi ya S3 (kwa Amazon S3: https://s3.<region>.amazonaws.com) na eneo la hifadhi (bucket).','Amazon S3 uses virtual-hosted addresses: switch off “Path-style addresses”. Most other services use path-style.'=>'Amazon S3 hutumia anwani za mwenyeji pepe: zima "Anwani za mtindo wa njia". Huduma zingine nyingi hutumia mtindo wa njia.','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”.'=>'Bandika thamani zilizo hapa chini, hifadhi, kisha ubonyeze "Jaribu muunganisho".','Storage settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio ya hifadhi imehifadhiwa.','Your cloud library is kept in Zinn Digital® storage with the space your plan includes. You can keep it in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket instead: then no Zinn Digital® quota applies, and every site you connect to the same bucket shares the library. Team libraries always use Zinn Digital® storage.'=>'Maktaba yako ya wingu inatunzwa katika hifadhi ya Zinn Digital® pamoja na nafasi inayojumuishwa katika mpango wako. Badala yake, unaweza kuiweka kwenye pipa lako mwenyewe la Cloudflare R2 au linalooana na S3: wakati huo hakuna kikosi cha Zinn Digital® kinachotumika, na kila tovuti unayounganisha kwenye pipa lilelile inashiriki maktaba hiyo. Maktaba za timu hutumia daima hifadhi ya Zinn Digital®.','Connect your own storage: step by step'=>'Unganisha hifadhi yako mwenyewe: hatua kwa hatua','Another S3-compatible service'=>'Huduma nyingine inayooana na S3','Read the full guide'=>'Soma mwongozo kamili','S3 endpoint'=>'Kituo cha mwisho cha S3','Bucket'=>'Hifadhi','Region'=>'Eneo','Cloudflare R2: auto.'=>'Cloudflare R2: otomatiki.','Access key ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha ufunguo wa ufikiaji','Stored. Leave empty to keep it.'=>'Imehifadhiwa. Acha wazi ili uidumishe.','Secret access key'=>'Ufunguo wa siri wa ufikiaji','Stored encrypted on this site and never shown again. Leave empty to keep it.'=>'Imehifadhiwa kwa njia ya usimbaji fiche kwenye tovuti hii na haionyeshwi tena. Iache wazi ili kuihifadhi.','Stored encrypted on this site. It is never sent to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Imehifadhiwa kwa njia ya usimbaji fiche kwenye tovuti hii. Haitumwi kamwe kwa Zinn Digital®.','Path-style addresses'=>'Anwani za mtindo wa njia','Folder in the bucket'=>'Folda kwenye ndoo','Save'=>'Hifadhi','Test connection'=>'Jaribu muunganisho','Remove these settings'=>'Ondoa mipangilio hii','Keep my library in this storage'=>'Weka maktaba yangu kwenye hifadhi hii','The connection test passed.'=>'Jaribio la muunganisho limefaulu.','Run “Test connection” first.'=>'Endesha "Jaribu muunganisho" kwanza.','Invite a site'=>'Alika tovuti','Who is it for? (optional)'=>'Ni ya nani? (si lazima)','Access'=>'Idhinisha','Use designs (read only)'=>'Tumia miundo (ya kusoma tu)','Use and save designs'=>'Tumia na uhifadhi miundo','Create invite code'=>'Undha msimbo wa mwaliko','Give this code to the site owner. It works once, for 7 days, and is shown only now:'=>'Mpe mwenye tovuti nambari hii ya siri. Inafanya kazi mara moja, kwa siku 7, na inaonyeshwa sasa hivi pekee:','Copy'=>'Nakili','Members'=>'Wanachama','No site has joined yet.'=>'Hakuna tovuti iliyojiunga bado.','use and save'=>'tumia na uhifadhi','read only'=>'soma tu','Delete team'=>'Futa timu','Delete this team and every design in its library?'=>'Futa timu hii na kila muundo katika maktaba yake?','This site joined the team library.'=>'Tovuti hii imejumuishwa kwenye maktaba ya timu.','This site uses the team library:'=>'Tovuti hii inatumia maktaba ya timu:','Leave'=>'Ondoka','Join a team with an invite code'=>'Jiunge na timu ukitumia msimbo wa mwaliko','Join'=>'Jiunge','Your teams'=>'Timu zako','New team name'=>'Jina jipya la timu','Create team'=>'Undha timu','Creating team libraries comes with the Agency plan.'=>'Kutengeneza maktaba za timu kunapatikana kwenye mpango wa Agency.','Save sections, pages and styles to your cloud library and reuse them on all your sites. Agencies can share a library with their team and clients. You can keep the library in Zinn Digital® storage or in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket.'=>'Hifadhi sehemu, kurasa na mitindo kwenye maktaba yako ya wingu na uzitumie tena kwenye tovuti zako zote. Mashirika yanaweza kushiriki maktaba na timu yao na wateja. Unaweza kuweka maktaba katika hifadhi ya Zinn Digital® au kwenye pipa lako mwenyewe la Cloudflare R2 au linaloendana na S3.','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro'=>'Pata Page Builder Sandwich Pro','Website kits'=>'Vifaa vya tovuti','Cloud library'=>'Maktaba ya wingu','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Imetengenezwa na Neil Lock, Mkurugenzi Mtendaji wa Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Toleo la %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Tovuti ya Page Builder Sandwich','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Tovuti ya Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio imehifadhiwa.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Tazama mipango ya Pro na bei','Front-end output'=>'Matokeo ya mbele','Class name prefix'=>'Kiambishi awali cha jina la darasa','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kila jina la darasa ambalo programu-jalizi huchapisha kwenye kurasa zako linaanza na kiambishi hiki, ili kurasa zisifunue ni programu-jalizi ipi iliyozijenga. Herufi ndogo 1 hadi 8 au tarakimu, zinazoanza na herufi moja.','Beta updates'=>'Sasisho za Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Tovuti hii hupokea matoleo ya beta kama sasisho.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Tovuti hii inapokea matoleo thabiti pekee.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Badilisha hii kwenye ukurasa wa Akaunti','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Matoleo ya Beta hutolewa kwa usakinishaji wa Pro wenye leseni ambao umeunganishwa na akaunti yao. Mara baada ya kuunganishwa, unaweza kujiunga kupitia ukurasa wa Akaunti.','Breakpoints saved. Pages pick up the new widths on their next view.'=>'Vigezo vya kukatisha vimehifadhiwa. Kurasa huchukua upana mpya katika mwonekano wao unaofuata.','Breakpoints'=>'Sehemu za Kuvunjilia mbali','Styles set for Tablet apply up to the tablet width, and styles set for Mobile up to the mobile width. Desktop styles apply everywhere else.'=>'Mitindo iliyowekwa kwa ajili ya Kompyuta Kibao inatumika hadi kufikia upana wa kompyuta kibao, na ile iliyowekwa kwa ajili ya Simu ya Mkononi hadi kufikia upana wa simu ya mkononi. Mitindo ya Kompyuta ya Mezani inatumika kwingineko kote.','Tablet: up to (px)'=>'Kompyuta kibao: hadi (px)','Mobile: up to (px)'=>'Simu ya mkononi: hadi (px)','Save breakpoints'=>'Hifadhi vituo vya kuvunja','Use the default widths'=>'Tumia upana chaguomsingi','Settings'=>'Mipangilio','Templates & kits'=>'Violezo na vifaa','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'Ombi la kubadilisha chapisho hili lilisimama kabla halijakamilika, kwa hiyo chapisho lilirukwa. Lifungue ili ulibadilishe, au ulibadilishe tena kutoka hapa.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Hakuna nakala rudufu ya chapisho hili ya kurejesha.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'Maudhui yaliyobadilishwa hayakuweza kuhifadhiwa.','Unknown error.'=>'Hitilafu isiyojulikana.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Hakuna maudhui ya zamani yaliyochunguzwa bado.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Inarejesha maudhui ya zamani: machapisho %1$d kati ya %2$d.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Inabadilisha maudhui ya zamani: machapisho %1$d kati ya %2$d.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'Tendua imekamilisha: %1$d zimerejeshwa, %2$d zimeshindwa.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'Ubadilishaji umekamilika: %1$d imebadilishwa, %2$d haijabadilishwa, %3$d imeshindwa.','Legacy content'=>'Maudhui ya zamani','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'Kurasa zilizoundwa kwa matoleo ya awali ya Page Builder Sandwich zinabadilishwa kuwa vizuizi kwa nyuma. Kila chapisho hifadhi rudufu yake inatengenezwa kwanza, kwa hivyo kila mabadiliko yanaweza kutenduliwa.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'Chapisho %d bado lina maudhui ya zamani.' . "\0" . 'Machapisho %d bado yana maudhui ya zamani.','%d post has a backup.'=>'Machapisho %d yana nakala rudufu.' . "\0" . 'Machapisho %d yana nakala rudufu.','%d post could not be handled'=>'Chapisho %d halikuweza kushughulikiwa' . "\0" . 'Machapisho %d hayakuweza kushughulikiwa','Post %d'=>'Chapisho %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Ubadilishaji umeanza. Unaendelea chinichini; unaweza kuacha ukurasa huu.','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'Rejesha kila chapisho lililobadilishwa kuwa maudhui yake ya awali? Mabadiliko yaliyofanywa kwa machapisho hayo tangu yalipobadilishwa yatapotea.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Tendeni limeanza. Linaendelea chinichini; unaweza kuacha ukurasa huu.','Undo all conversions'=>'Tendua mabadiliko yote','Item'=>'Kipengele','Open when the page loads'=>'Fungua ukurasa unapopakia','Title is a heading'=>'Kichwa cha habari ni kichwa cha sehemu','Make the title a heading when the items are sections of the page, so visitors can jump between them.'=>'Fanya kichwa cha habari kiwe kichwa cha sehemu wakati vipengele ni sehemu za ukurasa, ili wageni waweze kuruka kati yao.','Heading %d'=>'Kichwa cha habari %d','Question or section title'=>'Swali au kichwa cha sehemu','Accordion'=>'Akodioni','Only one item open at a time'=>'Kipengele kimoja tu ndicho kilicho wazi kwa wakati mmoja','Mark up as FAQ for search engines'=>'Weka alama kama Maswali Yanayoulizwa Mara kwa Mara kwa ajili ya injini za utafutaji','Adds FAQ structured data built from the titles (questions) and their text (answers).'=>'Inaongeza data iliyopangwa ya Maswali Yanayoulizwa Mara kwa Mara (FAQ) iliyojengwa kutoka kwa vichwa (maswali) na maandishi yake (majibu).','Alert'=>'Tahadhari','Information'=>'Taarifa','Success'=>'Imefanikiwa','Warnings and errors are announced to screen reader users straight away; information and success notices are read when they finish what they are doing.'=>'Maonyo na makosa hutangazwa kwa watumiaji wa visoma skrini mara moja; taarifa na arifa za mafanikio husomwa wanapomaliza kile wanachofanya.','Show icon'=>'Onyesha aikoni','Visitors can close it'=>'Wagenzi wanaweza kuifunga','Title (optional)'=>'Kichwa cha habari (si lazima)','Write the message…'=>'Andika ujumbe…','Centre'=>'Kituo','Badge'=>'Beji','Colour'=>'Rangi','Theme accent'=>'Rangi ya mandhari','Neutral'=>'Bila upande','Position'=>'Nafasi','Label'=>'Lebo','Booking calendar'=>'Kalenda ya kuweka nafasi','Service'=>'Huduma','Booking page address'=>'Anwani ya ukurasa wa kuweka nafasi','For example %s'=>'Kwa mfano %s','What the calendar is for, read out by screen readers and shown under it.'=>'Lengo la kalenda, linasomwa na visoma skrini na kuonyeshwa chini yake.','This is not a %s booking page address, so nothing will show on the page.'=>'Hii siyo anwani ya ukurasa wa kuweka miadi wa %s, kwa hiyo hakuna kitakachoonekana kwenye ukurasa.','Preview the calendar'=>'Hakiki kalenda','Link address'=>'Anwani ya kiungo','The button shows when it has both a label and an address.'=>'Kitufe huonekana ikiwa kina lebo na anwani zote mbili.','Open in a new tab'=>'Fungua katika kichupo kipya','Layout'=>'Mpangilio','Buttons below'=>'Vifungo vilivyo hapa chini','Buttons beside the text'=>'Vitufe vilivyo karibu na maandishi','Alignment'=>'Mpangilio','Main button'=>'Kitufe kikuu','Second button'=>'Kitufe cha pili','Heading…'=>'Inakaribia…','One sentence on why…'=>'Sentensi moja kuhusu kwanini…','Second button (optional)'=>'Kitufe cha pili (si lazima)','Checklist'=>'Orodha ya kukagua','Tick colour'=>'Rangi ya tiki','Lines'=>'Mistari','Line %d'=>'Mstari wa %d','Task…'=>'Kazi…','Add line'=>'Ongeza mstari','Language'=>'Lugha','Detect automatically'=>'Gundua kiotomatiki','No highlighting'=>'Hakuna uangaziaji','File name'=>'Jina la faili','Shown above the code, for example functions.php.'=>'Inaonyeshwa juu ya msimbo, kwa mfano functions.php.','Line numbers'=>'Nambari za mistari','Copy button'=>'Kitufe cha kunakili','Wrap long lines'=>'Funga mistari mirefu','Write or paste code…'=>'Andika au bandika msimbo…','Text'=>'Maandishi','Columns'=>'Nguzo','Highlight %s'=>'Angaza %s','Add column'=>'Ongeza safu wima','Rows'=>'Safu','Row %d'=>'Safu %d','Add row'=>'Ongeza safu','Caption (what is being compared)'=>'Maelezo (kinacholinganishwa)','Cell type: %s. Change'=>'Aina ya seli: %s. Badilisha','Phone call'=>'Simu ya mkononi','Text message'=>'Ujumbe wa maandishi','WhatsApp'=>'WhatsApp','Buttons'=>'Vifungo','Phone number, with country code'=>'Nambari ya simu, pamoja na nambari ya nchi','Button text'=>'Maandishi ya kitufe','Remove this button'=>'Ondoa kitufe hiki','Add a button'=>'Ongeza kitufe','WhatsApp message to start with (optional)'=>'Ujumbe wa WhatsApp wa kuanzia (si lazima)','Contact buttons'=>'Vitufe vya mawasiliano','Add a phone number, an email address or a WhatsApp number in the sidebar.'=>'Ongeza nambari ya simu, anwani ya barua pepe au nambari ya WhatsApp kwenye upau wa kando.','Dual heading'=>'Kichwa cha habari cha mara mbili','Heading level'=>'Kiwango cha kichwa','Use H1 once per page, for its main title.'=>'Tumia H1 mara moja kwa kila ukurasa, kwa kichwa chake kikuu.','Second part look'=>'Sehemu ya pili angalia','Accent colour'=>'Rangi ya lafudhi','Gradient'=>'Mandhari yenye rangi mchanganyiko','Outline'=>'Muhtasari','Underline'=>'Pigia mstari chini','Second part on its own line'=>'Sehemu ya pili kwenye mstari wake pekee','First part'=>'Sehemu ya kwanza','second part'=>'sehemu ya pili','Marker pen'=>'Kalamu ya wino','Thick underline'=>'Mstari mnene wa chini','Background'=>'Mandharinyuma','Highlight'=>'Angazia','Remove highlight'=>'Ondoa uwekaji alama','Drop cap'=>'Herufi kubwa ya kwanza','Large first letter'=>'Herufi kubwa ya kwanza','For the first letter in a box, choose the "Drop cap in a box" style.'=>'Kwa herufi ya kwanza kwenye sanduku, chagua mtindo wa "Herufi kubwa iliyotumbukizwa kwenye sanduku".','Drop cap in a box'=>'Herufi kubwa ya kwanza iliyo ndani ya sanduku','Accent bar'=>'Upau wa rangi','Pull quote (accent bar)'=>'Nukuu kuu (upau wa mkazo)','A quote from the text, set large beside a coloured bar to draw the eye.'=>'Nukuu kutoka katika maandishi, iliyowekwa kubwa kando ya upau wa rangi ili kuvutia macho.','quote'=>'nukuu','Feature list'=>'Orodha ya vipengele','On phones the features always stack.'=>'Kwenye simu vipengele huwa vinajipanga kwa wima kila wakati.','Feature %d'=>'Kipengele %d','Own icon'=>'Aikoni ya mmiliki','Feature…'=>'Kipengele…','Describe it…'=>'Elezea…','Add feature'=>'Ongeza kipengele','Install and activate Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms or Fluent Forms, then choose one of its forms here.'=>'Sakinisha na uwashe Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms au Fluent Forms, kisha uchague mojawapo ya fomu zake hapa.','Form plugin'=>'Programu jalizi ya fomu','Choose a form…'=>'Chagua fomu…','%s has no forms yet'=>'%s haina fomu bado','%s is not active on this site, so this form cannot be shown.'=>'%s haijawe 활성화a kwenye tovuti hii, kwa hivyo fomu hii haiwezi kuonyeshwa.','The form list could not be loaded.'=>'Orodha ya fomu haikuweza kupakiwa.','Form style'=>'Mtindo wa fomu','Fields'=>'Sehemu','Outlined'=>'Imeelezwa kwa mistari','Filled'=>'Imejazwa','Underlined'=>'Imesisitizwa chini','Button width'=>'Upana wa kitufe','Fit the text'=>'Linganisha maandishi','Full width'=>'Upana kamili','Colours, fonts, spacing and corners come from your site design and this block’s design settings.'=>'Rangi, fonti, nafasi na pembe zinatoka kwenye muundo wa tovuti yako na mipangilio ya muundo wa kizuizi hiki.','Show a form from your form plugin, styled to match your site.'=>'Onyesha fomu kutoka kwa programu jalizi yako ya fomu, ambayo imepambwa ili kuendana na tovuti yako.','Need a form plugin? Contact Form 7 is free.'=>'Unahitaji plagi ya fomu? Contact Form 7 ni bure.','Glossary'=>'Kamusi','Sort A to Z'=>'Panga A hadi Z','The page shows the terms in alphabetical order; here they stay in the order you wrote them.'=>'Ukurasa huu unaonyesha maneno kwa mpangilio wa alfabeti; hapa yanabaki katika mpangilio uliowaandika.','Show an A–Z index'=>'Onyesha faharisi ya A–Z','Link terms used elsewhere on this page'=>'Unganisha maneno yanayotumika pengine kwenye ukurasa huu','The first time each term appears in the page text it links to its definition. Headings, buttons, code and existing links are left alone.'=>'Mara ya kwanza kila neno linapotokea kwenye maandishi ya ukurasa huunganishwa na ufafanuzi wake. Vichwa vya habari, vitufe, msimbo na viungo vilivyopo huachwa jinsi vilivyo.','Terms'=>'Masharti','Term %d'=>'Kipindi %d','Term'=>'Kipindi','What it means…'=>'Maana yake…','Add term'=>'Ongeza neno','Icon list'=>'Orodha ya aikoni','One below the other'=>'Moja chini ya nyingine','Side by side'=>'Kando na kando','List item…'=>'Orodhesha kipengele…','Info box'=>'Sanduku la maelezo','Or choose any icon from the library:'=>'Au chagua ikoni yoyote kutoka kwenye maktaba:','Link text'=>'Maandishi ya kiungo','Say where the link goes ("See our prices"), not "Read more".'=>'Eleza mahali ambapo kiungo kinaelekea ("Tazama bei zetu"), sio "Soma zaidi".','A sentence or two…'=>'Sentensi moja au mbili...','section — a thematic section'=>'sehemu — sehemu ya maudhui','div — no meaning'=>'div — haina maana','header — introductory content'=>'kichwa cha habari — maudhui ya utangulizi','footer — closing content'=>'kijachini — maudhui ya mwisho','article — self-contained content'=>'makala — maudhui yanayojitegemea','aside — related content'=>'kando — maudhui yanayohusiana','main — the main content (once per page)'=>'main — maudhui kuu (mara moja kwa kila kurasa)','nav — navigation links'=>'urambaza — viungo vya urambazaji','Stack (flexbox, column)'=>'Safu (flexbox, safu wima)','Row (flexbox)'=>'Safu (flexbox)','Grid'=>'Gridi','Editing: %s'=>'Inahariri: %s','Lay out children as'=>'Panga vipengele vya ndani kama','Inherited (%s)'=>'Imetolewa kutoka kwa mzazi (%s)','Flexbox'=>'Flexbox','Stacked blocks'=>'Vizuvisi vilivyopangwa','Drag in the canvas, or type'=>'Buruta kwenye turubai, au andika','Content width'=>'Upana wa maudhui','Boxed (the theme’s content width)'=>'Boxed (upana wa maudhui ya mada)','Minimum height'=>'Urefu wa chini','HTML tag'=>'Lebo ya HTML','Make the whole block a link to'=>'Fanya block yote iwe kiungo cha kwenda','Link text for screen readers'=>'Maandishi ya kiungo kwa ajili ya wasomaji skrini','What the link does, for visitors who cannot see the block.'=>'Kile ambacho kiungo hufanya, kwa wageni ambao hawawezi kuona kizuizi hiki.','Do not put links or buttons inside a linked block: a link inside a link does not work in browsers.'=>'Usiweke viungo au vitufe ndani ya kizuizi kilichounganishwa: kiungo kilicho ndani ya kiungo hakifanyi kazi katika vivinjari.','Drag to resize these columns'=>'Buruta ili kubadilisha ukubwa wa nguzo hizi','Drag to resize this row'=>'Buruta ili kubadilisha ukubwa wa safu hii','Drag across cells to set how many columns and rows this block spans'=>'Buruta kwenye seli ili kuweka idadi ya safu wima na safu mlalo ambazo kizuizi hiki kinachukua','+ Column'=>'Ongeza safu wima','− Column'=>'Safu wima','+ Row'=>'+ Safu','− Row'=>'− Safu mlalo','Place'=>'Weka','Paste coordinates or an OpenStreetMap link'=>'Bandika viwianishi au kiungo cha OpenStreetMap','On openstreetmap.org, find the place, then copy the address from the browser bar, or right-click the map and choose "Show address".'=>'Kwenye openstreetmap.org, tafuta eneo hilo, kisha nakili anwani kutoka kwenye mwambaa wa kivinjari, au bofya kulia kwenye ramani na uchague "Onyesha anwani".','Latitude'=>'Latitudo','Longitude'=>'Longitudo','Zoom'=>'Kuza','Name of the place'=>'Jina la eneo hilo','Shown under the map and read out by screen readers.'=>'Inaonyeshwa chini ya ramani na kusomwa na visoma skrini.','Paste coordinates (for example 51.5074, -0.1278) or an OpenStreetMap link.'=>'Bandika viw 좌표 (kwa mfano 51.5074, -0.1278) au kiungo cha OpenStreetMap.','Coordinates or link'=>'Waratibu au kiungo','Preview the map'=>'Hakiki ramani','Check %1$s, %2$s on OpenStreetMap'=>'Angalia %1$s, %2$s kwenye OpenStreetMap','Published date'=>'Tarehe iliyochapishwa','Updated date (when it differs)'=>'Tarehe iliyosasishwa (ikiwa inatofautiana)','Categories'=>'Makundi','Tags'=>'Lebo','Reading time'=>'Muda wa kusoma','Comment count'=>'Idadi ya maoni','Details to show'=>'Maelezo ya kuonyesha','Choose at least one detail to show.'=>'Chagua angalau undani mmoja wa kuonyesha.','Progress bar'=>'Upau wa maendeleo','Maximum'=>'Kiwango cha juu','100 for a percentage; any other number for a count, such as 8 of 10.'=>'100 kwa asilimia; nambari nyingine yoyote kwa idadi, kama vile 8 kati ya 10.','Show the percentage'=>'Onyesha asilimia','A password is set. Visitors see a password form instead of this content until they enter it.'=>'Nenosiri limewekwa. Wageni huona fomu ya nenosiri badala ya maudhui haya hadi watakapoliingiza.','No password is set yet, so visitors see nothing here.'=>'Hakuna nenosiri lililowekwa bado, kwa hiyo wageni hawaoni chochote hapa.','New password'=>'Nywila mpya','Set the password'=>'Weka nenosiri','Password set. Save the page to apply it; visitors who had unlocked it will need the new one.'=>'Nenosiri limewekwa. Hifadhi ukurasa ili kulitumia; wageni walioufungua watahitaji jipya.','If Page Builder Sandwich is ever switched off, this content is shown to everyone.'=>'Ikiwa Page Builder Sandwich itazimwa wakati wowote, maudohui haya yanaonyeshwa kwa kila mtu.','Message above the password form (optional)'=>'Ujumbe ulio juu ya fomu ya nenosiri (hiari)','A/B test'=>'Jaribio la A/B','Test name'=>'Jina la jaribio','Visitors who see version B (%)'=>'Wagenzi wanaoona toleo B (%)','Goal (optional)'=>'Lengo (si lazima)','A conversion is a click on a link or button, or a form sent, inside the version. To count a click elsewhere on the page instead, enter its CSS selector, for example #buy-now.'=>'Geuzi ni kubofya kiungo au kitufe, au fomu iliyotumwa, ndani ya toleo hili. Ili kuhesabu kubofya pengine popote kwenye ukurasa badala yake, weka kitambulishi chake cha CSS (CSS selector), kwa mfano #buy-now.','See the results'=>'Tazama matokeo','An A/B test needs exactly two versions.'=>'Jaribio la A/B linahitaji matoleo mawili kamili.','Button'=>'Kitufe','Visit site'=>'Tembelea tovuti','Style'=>'Mtindo','Affiliate button'=>'Kitufe cha washirika','Give the button its text and the offer’s address in the sidebar.'=>'Mpe kitufe hicho maandishi yake na anwani ya toleo kwenye upau wa pembeni.','Age check'=>'Ukaguzi wa umri','Put this block on every page that needs it, or in your header template part to cover the whole site.'=>'Weka kizuizi hiki kwenye kila ukurasa unaohitaji, au katika sehemu ya kiolezo chako cha kichwa ili kufunika tovuti nzima.','Minimum age'=>'Umri wa chini kabisa','Ask for'=>'Omba','A yes or no answer'=>'Jibu la ndiyo au hapana','The date of birth'=>'Tarehe ya kuzaliwa','Remember the answer for (days)'=>'Kumbuka jibu kwa (days)','Texts'=>'Maandishi','Leave a text empty to use the standard one. {age} is replaced by the minimum age.'=>'Acha maandishi wazi ili utumie lile la kawaida. {age} inabadilishwa na umri wa chini.','Question'=>'Swali','When the visitor is too young'=>'Wakati mgeni ni mdogo sana','Countries'=>'Nchi','A different minimum age for visitors from a country, or 0 to close the site to it. The country comes from your host or CDN (for example Cloudflare); where it is unknown, the minimum age above applies. A page cache must keep one copy per country for these rules to apply to cached pages.'=>'Umri tofauti wa chini kabisa kwa wageni kutoka nchi, au 0 ili kufunga tovuti kwa nchi hiyo. Nchi hiyo inatoka kwa mwenyeji wako au CDN (kwa mfano Cloudflare); ambapo haijulikani, umri wa chini hapo juu unatumika. Akiba ya kurasa lazima iweke nakala moja kwa kila nchi ili sheria hizi zitumike kwa kurasa zilizowekwa kwenye akiba.','Add a country'=>'Ongeza nchi','Country code (two letters)'=>'Msimbo wa nchi (herua mbili)','For example US, GB, DE.'=>'Kwa mfano US, GB, DE.','Minimum age (0: closed)'=>'Umri wa chini (0: umefungwa)','Age gate'=>'Kikomo cha umri','The age question shows here.'=>'Swali la umri linaonekana hapa.','Changing words'=>'Inabadilisha maneno','Word'=>'Neno','Add a word'=>'Ongeza neno','Animated headline'=>'Kichwa cha habari kinachosonga','Text before'=>'Maandishi kabla','Text after'=>'Maandishi baada ya','Effect'=>'Athari','Fade'=>'Fifisha','Slide up'=>'Teleza juu','Typing'=>'Kuandika','Time per word (milliseconds)'=>'Muda kwa kila neno (milisekunde)','Add the words that change in the block settings.'=>'Ongeza maneno yanayobadilika katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','Typewriter'=>'Typewriter','Words fade in'=>'Maneno yanaonekana taratibu','Words rise in'=>'Maneno yanaongezeka','Plays once, when the text scrolls into view. Visitors who ask their device for less motion see the text still.'=>'Inacheza mara moja, wakati maandishi yanapoonekana kwenye skrini. Wageni wanaoomba vifaa vyao kupunguza mwendo huona maandishi yakiwa yametulia.','Speed'=>'Kasi','Slow'=>'Polepole','Normal'=>'Kawaida','Fast'=>'Haraka','Write the text to animate…'=>'Andika maandishi ya kuhuisha...','Audio player'=>'Kicheza sauti','Show or album name'=>'Jina la onyesho au albamu','Replace artwork'=>'Badilisha mchoro','Choose artwork'=>'Chagua mchoro','Add an episode'=>'Ongeza kipindi','Choose audio file'=>'Chagua faili ya sauti','Replace audio file'=>'Badilisha faili ya sauti','or its address'=>'au anwani yake','Add episodes in the sidebar.'=>'Ongeza vipindi kwenye mwambaa wa pembeni.','Autho