sa wa nyumbani hauna.','From'=>'Kutoka','To'=>'Hadi','Remove these hours on %s'=>'Ondoa saa hizi mnamo %s','Add hours (for a break)'=>'Ongeza saa (kwa ajili ya mapumziko)','Copy Monday to Tuesday–Friday'=>'Nakili Jumatatu hadi Jumatatu–Ijumaa','Hours that end after midnight (18:00 to 02:00) belong to the day they start. Times are in the site’s time zone (Settings › General).'=>'Masaa yanayoishia baada ya usiku wa manane (18:00 hadi 02:00) ni ya siku yanayoanza. Nyakati ziko katika eneo la saa la tovuti (Mipangilio › Jumla).','Display'=>'Onyesha','Empty: read out by screen readers only.'=>'Tupu: husomwa na visoma-skrini pekee.','Say whether it is open now'=>'Sema kama iko wazi sasa','Highlight today'=>'Angaza ya leo','Note under the hours'=>'Ujumbe chini ya saa','Closed on public holidays.'=>'Imefungwa siku kuu za umma.','Offers'=>'Matoleo','Add an offer'=>'Ongeza ofa','New offer'=>'Ofa mpya','Table'=>'Jedwali','Caption'=>'Maelezo mafupi','Shown above the table and read out by screen readers.'=>'Inaonyeshwa juu ya jedwali na kusomwa na visoma skrini.','Rank column'=>'Safu ya cheo','Rating column'=>'Safu ya ukadiriaji','Highlights column'=>'Safu ya mambo muhimu','Notice under the table'=>'Ilani chini ya jedwali','Casino comparison table'=>'Jedwali la kulinganisha kasino','Add the offers in the sidebar, best first.'=>'Ongeza matoleo kwenye upau wa pembeni, yaliyo bora kwanza.','Kind'=>'Aina','Bars'=>'Upaupa','Line'=>'Mstari','Pie (first series only)'=>'Pie (safu ya kwanza tu)','Shown above the chart and read out as its name.'=>'Inaonyeshwa juu ya chati na kusomwa kama jina lake.','Before each value'=>'Kabla ya kila thamani','For example $ or €.'=>'Kwa mfano $ au €.','After each value'=>'Baada ya kila thamani','For example kg, or the percent sign.'=>'Kwa mfano kg, au ishara ya asilimia.','Show a legend'=>'Onyesha maelezo ya alama','Print each value on the chart'=>'Chapisha kila thamani kwenye chati','Height'=>'Urefu','Short'=>'Fupi','Tall'=>'Ndefu','Add categories and n