','As you want it shown, for example "31 December".'=>'Kama unavyotaka ionyeshwe, kwa mfano "31 Desemba".','Enter the code in the block settings.'=>'Weka msimbo kwenye mipangilio ya kizuizi.','Prices'=>'Bei','Show as'=>'Onyesha kama','Scrolling ticker'=>'Kipenyo kinachosonga','Cards'=>'Kadi','Price chart (one coin)'=>'Chati ya bei (sarafu moja)','Period'=>'Kipindi','24 hours'=>'saa 24','7 days'=>'Siku 7','30 days'=>'siku 30','90 days'=>'siku 90','Currency'=>'Sarafu','Coins'=>'Sarafu','Prices come from CoinGecko and are kept on your site for a few minutes, so visitors never wait for it.'=>'Bei hutoka CoinGecko na huwekwa kwenye tovuti yako kwa dakika chache, ili wageni wasisubiri kamwe.','Crypto prices'=>'Bei za sarafu za mtandaoni','Choose the coins in the sidebar.'=>'Chagua sarafu kwenye mwambaa wa kando.','Cursor effect'=>'Athari ya kielekezi','A ring follows the pointer'=>'Pete linafuata kielekezi','A soft spotlight'=>'Mwangaza hafifu','A trail of dots'=>'Msururu wa nukta','Where'=>'Ambapo','Over this section'=>'Zaidi ya sehemu hii','Over the whole page'=>'Katika ukurasa wote','The real pointer always stays. The effect is off on touch screens and for visitors who ask their device for less motion.'=>'Kielezo halisi kinakaa kila wakati. Athari hii haifanyi kazi kwenye skrini za kugusa na kwa wageni ambao wameomba vifaa vyao viwe na mwendo mdogo.','Switch'=>'Badili','Number'=>'Nambari','That has no rows under its first line. The first line is used for the column names.'=>'Hiyo haina safu wima chini ya mstari wake wa kwanza. Mstari wa kwanza unatumika kwa ajili ya majina ya safu wima.','Import a CSV file'=>'Ingiza faili la CSV','Or paste CSV'=>'Au bandika CSV','Comma, semicolon or tab separated. The first line holds the column names. Importing replaces the table.'=>'Imetenganishwa kwa koma, nukta-mkato au tabu. Mstari wa kwanza una majina ya safu wima. Uingizaji unachukua nafasi ya jedwali hilo.','Import pasted CSV'=>'Ingiza CSV iliyobandikwa','Says what the table shows. Screen readers announce it even when it is empty on screen.'=>'Inasema kile jedwali kinachoonyesha. Wasomaji wa skrini huitangaza hata ikiwa tupu kwenye skrini.','Visitors can sort by a column'=>'Wagenzi wanaweza kupanga kwa safu wima','Show a search field'=>'Onyesha sehemu ya utafutaji','First column names each row'=>'Safu ya kwanza inataja kila safu mlalo','Sort “%s” as'=>'Panga “%s” kama','Remove column'=>'Odoa safu','Import CSV'=>'Ingiza CSV','On a narrow screen'=>'Kwenye skrini nyembamba','Each row becomes a card'=>'Kila safu inakuwa kadi','The table scrolls sideways'=>'Jedwali linasogeza upande','Striped rows'=>'Mistari yenye mistari mbadala','Import a spreadsheet as CSV, paste one, or start with an empty table.'=>'Ingiza lahajedwali kama CSV, bandika nyingine, au anza na jedwali tupu.','Start with an empty table'=>'Anza na jedwali tupu','Name of column %d'=>'Jina la safu %d','Row %1$d, %2$s'=>'Safu %1$d, %2$s','Remove row %d'=>'Ondoa safu %d','Events'=>'Matukio','Add an event'=>'Ongeza tukio','Starts'=>'Inaanza','In the site’s time zone (Settings › General).'=>'Katika eneo la saa la tovuti (Mipangilio › Jumla).','Ends (optional)'=>'Inaisha (si lazima)','Web address (optional)'=>'Anwani ya mtandao (si lazima)','Tickets or details. The title links to it.'=>'Tiketi au maelezo. Kichwa cha habari kinaleta kiungo kwake.','All day'=>'Siku nzima','A list'=>'Orodha','A month calendar'=>'Kalenda ya mwezi','Keep past events'=>'Weka matukio ya zamani','Off: an event leaves the page once it has ended.'=>'Imezimwa: tukio huondoka kwenye ukurasa mara tu linapomalizika.','Add the first event in the sidebar.'=>'Ongeza tukio la kwanza kwenye mwambaa wa pembeni.','Front'=>'Mbele','Button link'=>'Kiungo cha kitufe','Flip box'=>'Sanduku linalopindka','Flip'=>'Geuza','Write the front and the back in the block settings.'=>'Andika upande wa mbele na wa nyuma katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','Loading lists…'=>'Inapakia orodha...','List'=>'Orodha','Choose a list'=>'Chagua orodha','