ead out by screen readers'=>'Jina linalosomwa na visoma skrini','Visitors get a pause button, and it stops while they point at it. It stays still for visitors who ask for less motion.'=>'Wagenzi wanapata kitufe cha kusitisha, na kinasimama wakati wakinyoshea kidole. Kinakaa kimya kwa wagenzi wanaoomba mwendo mdogo.','Item %d'=>'Kipengele %d','Remove item %d'=>'Ondoa kipengee %d','Add item'=>'Ongeza bidhaa','Mega menu'=>'Menyu kuu','Show under'=>'Onyesha chini ya','The top-level menu item that opens this panel.'=>'Kipengele cha menyu ya kiwango cha juu kinachofungua kidirisha hiki.','Choose an item…'=>'Chagua kipengele…','As wide as its content'=>'Kama upana wa maudhui yake','As wide as the menu bar'=>'Kama upana wa upau wa menyu','Mega menu for “%s”'=>'Menyu kuu ya “%s”','Mega menu: choose its menu item in the sidebar.'=>'Menyu kuu: chagua kipengee chake cha menyu kwenye upau wa pembeni.','Phones'=>'Simu','Accordion on phones'=>'Accordion kwenye simu za mkononi','On narrow screens each tab becomes a section that opens and closes on its own.'=>'Kwenye skrini nyembamba, kila kichupo huwa sehemu inayofunguka na kufunga yenyewe.','3D model'=>'Mfano wa 3D','Choose a model (GLB or glTF)'=>'Chagua mfano (GLB au glTF)','Description (required)'=>'Maelezo (inahitajika)','What the model shows: it is what a screen reader announces.'=>'Kile kinachonyeshwa na modeli: ni kile kinachotangazwa na kisoma skrini.','Poster image shown while it loads'=>'Picha ya bango inaonyeshwa wakati inapakiwa','Turn slowly on its own'=>'Geuza polepole peke yake','Offer "view in your space" (AR) on phones'=>'Toa hudhaa ya "angalia katika nafasi yako" (AR) kwenye simu','Choose a 3D model in the sidebar.'=>'Chagua muundo wa 3D kwenye upau wa kando.','Choose a menu…'=>'Chagua menyu…','Only people who can edit the site’s menus can choose one here.'=>'Ni watu tu wanaoweza kuhariri menyu ya tovuti wanaoweza kuchagua moja hapa.','Navigation menu'=>'Menyu ya urambazaji','Choose which WordPress menu to show.'