ngua kiungo katika kichupo kipya','Highlight this plan'=>'Angazia mpango huu','A short label above the plan, such as "Most popular".'=>'Lebo fupi juu ya mpango, kama vile "Maarufu zaidi".','Pricing table'=>'Jedwali la bei','Currency symbol'=>'Alama ya sarafu','Monthly / yearly switch'=>'Badilisha kati ya mwezi na mwaka','Shows a switch when at least one plan has a yearly price.'=>'Inaonyesha swichi wakati angalau mpango mmoja una bei ya kila mwaka.','Monthly button text'=>'Maandishi ya kitufe cha kila mwezi','Yearly button text'=>'Maandishi ya kitufe cha mwaka','Yearly saving'=>'Akiba ya mwaka','For example "Save 20%".'=>'Kwa mfano "Okoa 20%".','Add a plan in the block settings.'=>'Ongeza mpango katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','Out of'=>'Kati ya','A percentage'=>'Asilimia','The value out of the total'=>'Thamani kati ya jumla','Ring'=>'Sauti ya Simu','Thickness'=>'Unene','Thin'=>'Nyembamba','Thick'=>'Nene','Label (optional)'=>'Lebo (hiari)','Promo bar'=>'Upau wa matangazo','Top, stays in view'=>'Juu, inakaa kwenye mwonekano','Bottom of the screen'=>'Chini ya skrini','Where it is placed'=>'Mahali ilipowekwa','Colours'=>'Rangi','Accent'=>'Lugha','Write the announcement in the block settings.'=>'Andika tangazo katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','One per line'=>'Moja kwa kila mstari','Headings'=>'Vichwa vya habari','Add the pros and cons in the sidebar, one per line.'=>'Ongeza faida na hasara kwenye upau wa pembeni, moja kwa kila mstari.','Optional, for example “Reading time:”.'=>'Si lazima, kwa mfano "Wakati wa kusoma:".','Format'=>'Umbiza','5 minutes read'=>'Dakika 5 za kusoma','5 min read'=>'Soma ya dakika 5','Reading speed (words a minute)'=>'Kasi ya kusoma (maneno kwa dakika)','How long the post takes to read shows here.'=>'Muda ambao chapisho huchukua kusomwa unaonekana hapa.','Score'=>'Alama','Overall score'=>'Alama ya jumla','Verdict'=>'Hukumu','Criteria'=>'Vigezo','Add a criterion'=>'Ongeza kigezo','Criterion'=>'Kigezo','Set the score in the sidebar.'=>'Weka alama kw