'Tovuti yote','Device share menu'=>'Menyu ya ushiriki wa kifaa','Share to'=>'Shiriki kwa','Share bar'=>'Upau wa kushiriki','For example "Share". Left empty, no label is shown.'=>'Kwa mfano "Shiriki". Ikiachwa wazi, hakuna lebo inayoonyeshwa.','Floating at the side (wide screens)'=>'Inazoe upande (skrini pana)','The buttons appear once the page has an address (save it as a draft).'=>'Vifungo vinaonekana mara tu ukurasa unapokuwa na anwani (kihifadhi kama rasimu).','Networks'=>'Mitandao','Device share button'=>'Kitufe cha kushiriki kifaa','Phones and some browsers offer their own share sheet; the button appears only where one exists.'=>'Simu na vivinjari vingine vinatoa karatasi yao ya kushiriki; kitufe kinaonekana tu mahali ambapo lipo.','Look'=>'Tazama','Show network names'=>'Onyesha majina ya mtandao','Shape'=>'Umbo','Rounded'=>'Imepindikawa pembe','Circle'=>'Mzunguko','Square'=>'Mraba','Edit images (%d)'=>'Hariri picha (%d)','Choose images'=>'Chagua picha','Content type'=>'Aina ya maudhui','Items per page'=>'Vipengele kwa kila ukurasa','Only these categories'=>'Kategoria hizi pekee','None chosen: every category.'=>'Hakuna iliyochaguliwa: kila kategoria.','Oldest first'=>'Kongwe kwanza','Title, A to Z'=>'Kichwa cha habari, A hadi Z','Recently updated'=>'Imesasishwa hivi karibuni','Custom order'=>'Agizo maalum','Random'=>'Nasibu','Summary'=>'Muhtasari','Price (products)'=>'Bei (bidhaa)','Card'=>'Kadi','Previous and next buttons'=>'Vifungo vya nyuma na mbele','Start again after the last'=>'Anza tena baada ya ya mwisho','Play automatically'=>'Cheza kiotomatiki','Never for visitors who prefer less motion; pauses on hover and focus, and has a Stop button.'=>'Haiwahi kuonyeshwa kwa wageni wanaopenda mwendo mdogo; inasitisha inapoelea na kuzingatiwa, na ina kitufe cha Kusitisha.','Seconds per slide'=>'Sekunde kwa kila slaidi','Move up'=>'Hamisha juu','Move down'=>'Shusha chini','Remove column %s'=>'Ondoa safu wima %s','The first line holds the column names. Importing replaces what is here.'=>'Mstari wa kwanza una majina ya safu wima. Kuleta data kutachukua nafasi ya kilicho hapa.','Remove image'=>'Ondoa picha','%1$s %2$d'=>'%1$s %2$d','Pick the level that fits the outline of the page.'=>'Chagua kiwango kinacholingana na muhtasari wa ukurasa.','Replace photo'=>'Badilisha picha','Move %s up'=>'Hamisha %s juu','Move %s down'=>'Hamisha %s chini','Duplicate %s'=>'Nakili %s','Remove %s'=>'Ondoa %s','Rating (0 to 5)'=>'Ukadiriaji (0 hadi 5)','Highlights, one per line'=>'Vivutio, kimoja kwa kila mstari','Optional, for example “Top pick”.'=>'Si lazima, kwa mfano “Chaguo bora”.','Terms (shown with the offer)'=>'Masharti (yanaonyeshwa pamoja na toleo)','The key terms your licence requires next to the offer, for example the wagering requirement.'=>'Masharti muhimu ambayo leseni yako inahitaji karibu na ofa, kwa mfano sharti la kuweka dau.','Replace logo'=>'Badilisha nembo','Choose logo'=>'Chagua nembo','Remove logo'=>'Odoa nembo','Give the short link a name, and the offer a full address starting with https://.'=>'Ipe kiungo kifupi jina, na ofa anwani kamili inayoanza na https://.','The short link could not be saved.'=>'Kiungo kifupi hakikuweza kuhifadhiwa.','Offer address'=>'Anwani ya ofa','Your affiliate link. Links to offers are always marked as sponsored for search engines.'=>'Kiungo chako cha ushirika. Viungo vya ofa huwekwa alama kila wakati kama vimefadhiliwa kwa injini za utafutaji.','Go through a short link'=>'Pitia kupitia kiungo kifupi','Visitors see a short address on your site, and every click is counted in Short links.'=>'Wagenzi wanaona anwani fupi kwenye tovuti yako, na kila kubofya kunahesabiwa katika Viungo vifupi.','Visitors will see %s'=>'Wagenzi wataona %s','Or make a new one, named'=>'Au unda mpya, yenye jina','spin-palace'=>'spin-palace','Create short link from the address'=>'Tengeneza kiungo kifupi kutoka kwa anwani hiyo','Height before the button'=>'Urefu kabla ya kitufe','Button text when open'=>'Maandishi ya kitufe wakati kiko wazi','Header'=>'Kichwa cha habari','Sticky'=>'Inayoshikamana','Stays at the top of the screen while visitors scroll.'=>'Inabaki juu ya skrini huku wageni wakisogeza ukurasa.','Transparent'=>'Wazi','Lies over the first section of the page, and takes the site’s background colour once the page scrolls. Give the first section enough space at the top.'=>'Iko juu ya sehemu ya kwanza ya ukurasa, na huchukua rangi ya usuli ya tovuti ukurasa unapoteremka. Ipe sehemu ya kwanza nafasi ya kutosha juu.','Slides come from'=>'Slideti zinatoka','Blocks I add'=>'Vizuizi ninavyoongeza','Posts'=>'Machapisho','Products (WooCommerce)'=>'Bidhaa (WooCommerce)','Slide'=>'Teleza','Ken Burns (slow zoom, images)'=>'Ken Burns (kuza polepole, picha)','Slides in view: desktop'=>'Slaidi zinazoonekana: kompyuta ya mezani','Slides in view: tablet'=>'Vipindi vinavyoonekana kwenye skrini: kompyuta kibao','Slides in view: phone'=>'Slaidi zinazoonekana: simu','What the slides are, for example "Customer stories".'=>'Nini slaidi hizo zilivyo, kwa mfano "Hadithi za wateja".','Image slider'=>'Kitelezo cha picha','Images from the media library, one after another.'=>'Picha kutoka kwenye maktaba ya media, moja baada ya nyingine.','Post slider'=>'Kitelezi cha machapisho','Product slider'=>'Kitelezo cha bidhaa','WooCommerce products as a carousel.'=>'Bidhaa za WooCommerce kama kizingirio.','Ken Burns slideshow'=>'Onyesho la slaidi la Ken Burns','Full-width images with a slow zoom, fading from one to the next.'=>'Picha zenye upana kamili zenye kukuza polepole, zikitoweka kutoka moja hadi nyingine.','Recent sales notices — example, shown only in the editor'=>'Arifa za hivi punde za mauzo — mfano, zinaonyeshwa kwenye kihariri pekee','First name from Town bought Product'=>'Jina la kwanza kutoka Town limenunua Product','2 hours ago'=>'Saa 2 zilizopita','Orders'=>'Maagizo','Orders from'=>'Maagizo kutoka kwa','WooCommerce and Easy Digital Downloads'=>'WooCommerce na Easy Digital Downloads','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Easy Digital Downloads'=>'Easy Digital Downloads','Most recent orders to show'=>'Maagizo ya hivi karibuni ya kuonyesha','Oldest order (days)'=>'Agizo la zamani zaidi (siku)','Name the product'=>'Weka jina la bidhaa','Say how long ago'=>'Eleza muda uliopita','Timing and place'=>'Wakati na mahali','Each notice shows for (seconds)'=>'Kila taarifa inaonekana kwa (sekunde)','Pause between notices (seconds)'=>'Sitisho kati ya matangazo (sekunde)','Bottom, reading start'=>'Chini, kusoma kunaanza','Bottom, reading end'=>'Chini, mwisho wa kusoma','Where the notices come from'=>'Mahali arifa zinakotoka','Only real, paid orders are shown, and only when the buyer ticked the box at checkout that lets this site show their first name and town. Once this page is saved, the checkout offers that box. Until an order with it arrives, visitors see nothing.'=>'Orodha za kweli na zilizolipwa pekee ndizo zinazoonyeshwa, na tu wakati mnunuzi alipoweka alama kwenye kisanduku wakati wa kulipa kinachoruhusu tovuti hii kuonyesha jina lake la kwanza na mji wake. Ukurasa huu ukishahifadhiwa, sehemu ya kulipa hutoa kisanduku hicho. Hadi agizo lenye kipengele hicho litakapofika, wageni hawaoni chochote.','Find the coordinates from the address'=>'Tafuta huratibu kutoka kwa anwani','Found. Check the pin on the map on the page.'=>'Imepatikana. Angalia pini kwenye ramani kwenye ukurasa.','No match. Try the street, town and postcode, or type the coordinates.'=>'Hakuna matokeo. Jaribu mtaa, mji na msimbo wa posta, au andika viwianishi.','OpenStreetMap did not answer. Try again in a minute, or type the coordinates.'=>'OpenStreetMap haikujibu. Jaribu tena baada ya dakika moja, au andika viwianishi.','Sends the address to OpenStreetMap (Nominatim) and fills in the latitude and longitude.'=>'Inatuma anwani kwa OpenStreetMap (Nominatim) na kujaza latitudo na longitudo.','Locations'=>'Maeneo','Add a location'=>'Ongeza eneo','Search and “Nearest to me”'=>'Tafuta na “Iliyo karibu nami”','Offer a map'=>'Toa ramani','Visitors press “Show the map” first: nothing loads from OpenStreetMap until they do.'=>'Wagenzi huanza kwa kubofya “Onyesha ramani”: hakuna kinachopakiwa kutoka OpenStreetMap hadi wafanye hivyo.','Map zoom (0 = fit every location)'=>'Kuza ramani (0 = onyesha maeneo yote)','Add the first location in the sidebar.'=>'Ongeza eneo la kwanza kwenye mwambaa wa pembeni.','Pane'=>'Dirisha','Name on the switch'=>'Jina kwenye swichi','Person'=>'Mtu','Short bio'=>'Wasifu mfupi','Photo'=>'Picha','Photo: alternative text'=>'Picha: maandishi mbadala','Leave empty when the photo only repeats the name.'=>'Acha wazi wakati picha inarudia jina tu.','Profile links'=>'Viungo vya wasifu','Add a link'=>'Ongeza kiungo','Network'=>'Mtandao','LinkedIn'=>'LinkedIn','X'=>'X','Facebook'=>'Facebook','Instagram'=>'Instagram','GitHub'=>'GitHub','YouTube'=>'YouTube','Mastodon'=>'Mastodon','Bluesky'=>'Bluesky','Add a person in the block settings.'=>'Ongeza mtu katika mipangilio ya kuzuia.','Event'=>'Tukio','Add an event in the block settings.'=>'Ongeza tukio katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','Badges'=>'Beji','Add a badge'=>'Ongeza beji','Trust badges'=>'Beji za kuaminiwa','Row'=>'Safu','Add a badge in the block settings.'=>'Ongeza beji katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','Videos'=>'Video','Add a video'=>'Ongeza video','Video address (YouTube, Vimeo or a file)'=>'Anwani ya video (YouTube, Vimeo au faili)','Poster image (optional)'=>'Picha ya jalada (si lazima)','Replace poster'=>'Badilisha bango','Add videos in the sidebar.'=>'Ongeza video kwenye utepe wa kando.','Name of the list'=>'Jina la orodha','Web address or text'=>'Anwani ya wavuti au maandishi','QR code'=>'Msimbo wa QR','Description for screen readers'=>'Maelezo kwa ajili ya wasomaji wa skrini','Leave empty to use "QR code for" and the text.'=>'Acha wazi ili kutumia "QR code for" na maandishi.','Type a web address, a phone link (tel:) or any text.'=>'Andika anwani ya tovuti, kiungo cha simu (tel:) au maandishi yoyote.','This is too long for a QR code. Shorten it.'=>'Hii ni ndefu sana kwa msimbo wa QR. Ifupishe.','Add a caption'=>'Weka maelezo','Reading progress bar'=>'Upau wa maendeleo ya kusoma','Edge of the window'=>'Ukingo wa dirisha','Top'=>'Juu','Bottom'=>'Chini','Shown along the bottom of the window as visitors scroll.'=>'Inaonyeshwa chini ya dirisha wakati wageni wanapoteremka chini.','Shown along the top of the window as visitors scroll.'=>'Inaونیka kwenye sehemu ya juu ya dirisha wakati wageni wanaposogeza ukurasa.','Related by'=>'Imehusishwa na','Categories or tags'=>'Jamii au lebo','When nothing is related, show the newest instead'=>'Wakati hakuna kinachohusiana, onesha kipya zaidi badala yake','Leave empty for "Related posts".'=>'Acha wazi kwa ajili ya "Machapisho yanayohusiana".','Show the featured image'=>'Onyesha picha iliyoangaziwa','Show a summary'=>'Onyesha muhtasari','No posts share this post’s categories or tags yet. When some do, they show here.'=>'Hakuna machapisho yanayoshiriki kategoria au lebo za chapisho hili bado. Yatakapokuwepo, yataonekana hapa.','Modal'=>'Modali','Off-canvas panel'=>'Paneli ya nje ya turubai','Slides in from'=>'Inateleza kutoka upande wa','Start is the side where reading begins: the left in English, the right in Arabic.'=>'Mwanzo ndipo upande ambapo usomaji huanza: upande wa kushoto kwa Kiingereza, upande wa kulia kwa Kiarabu.','Close when the page behind is clicked'=>'Funga ukurasa wa nyuma unapobofya','Title of the window'=>'Kichwa cha dirisha','Check mark'=>'Alama ya vema','Cross'=>'Vuka','Dot'=>'Nukta','Arrow'=>'Mshale','Star'=>'Weka Nyota','Icon colour'=>'Rangi ya ikoni','Same as the text'=>'Sawa na maandishi','Theme primary'=>'Mandhari ya msingi','Theme secondary'=>'Mandhari ya pili','Theme contrast'=>'Ulinganifu wa mandhari','Keep headings in order down the page: a heading one level below the section it sits in.'=>'Weka vichwa vya habari kwa mpangilio chini ya ukurasa: kichwa cha habari kiwe kiwango kimoja chini ya sehemu kilipo.','Choose icon'=>'Chagua aikoni','Use the default icon'=>'Tumia aikoni chaguo-msingi','Choose an icon'=>'Chagua ikoni','Show a heading for each type'=>'Onyesha kichwa cha habari kwa kila aina','Nothing published yet in the types you chose.'=>'Hakuna kilichochapishwa bado katika aina ulizochagua.','Links'=>'Viungo','Link %d'=>'Unganisha %d','A profile address, mailto:you@example.com or tel:+441234567890.'=>'Anwani ya wasifu, mailto:you@example.com au tel:+441234567890.','Name read to screen readers'=>'Jina linalosomwa kwa visomaji skrini','Other icon'=>'Ikoni nyingine','Add link'=>'Ongeza kiungo','Icon only'=>'Aikoni pekee','Rounded square'=>'Mraba wenye pembe za mviringo','Open profiles in a new tab'=>'Fungua wasifu katika kichupo kipya','Star rating'=>'Ukadiriaji wa nyota','Number of stars'=>'Idadi ya nyota','Show the number'=>'Onyesha nambari','Down the page'=>'Chini ya ukurasa','Side by side (stacks on phones)'=>'Ubavu kwa ubavu (inarundika kwenye simu)','Number colour'=>'Rangi ya namba','Order of the steps'=>'Mpangilio wa hatua','Step %d'=>'Hatua ya %d','Step…'=>'Hatua...','What to do…'=>'Cha kufanya…','Add step'=>'Ongeza hatua','Tab'=>'Tabu','Add headings to the page and they will be listed here.'=>'Ongeza vichwa vya habari kwenye kurasa na vitaorodheshwa hapa.','Table of contents'=>'Jedwali la yaliyomo','From heading level'=>'Kutoka ngazi ya kichwa','To heading level'=>'Hadi kiwango cha kichwa','Numbered'=>'Zilizopewa namba','Can be collapsed'=>'Inaweza kukunjwa','Start collapsed'=>'Anza imekunjwa','Highlight the section being read'=>'Angazia sehemu inayomilikiwa kusomwa','Tabs'=>'Tabu','Optional. Says what the tabs are about, for example "Plans".'=>'Si lazima. Inaelezea kile ambacho tabu zinahusu, kwa mfano "Mipango".','Open on page load'=>'Fungua wakati wa kupakia ukurasa','Tabs down the side'=>'Tabu kando','Add a tab'=>'Ongeza kichupo','Testimonial'=>'Ushuhuda','Choose photo'=>'Chagua picha','Remove photo'=>'Ondoa picha','Photo description'=>'Maelezo ya picha','Leave empty when the photo only shows the person named next to it.'=>'Acha tupu wakati picha inaonyesha tu mtu aliyetajwa karibu nayo.','Star rating (0 = none)'=>'Ukadiriaji wa nyota (0 = hakuna)','Name under the quote'=>'Jina chini ya nukuu','Photo beside the quote'=>'Picha kando ya nukuu','What the customer said…'=>'Alichosema mteja…','Role or company'=>'Jukumu au kampuni','Tooltip'=>'Kidokezo','Tooltip text'=>'Maandishi ya vidokezo','Keep it short: one or two sentences. Screen readers read it with the word it explains.'=>'Iwe fupi: sentensi moja au mbili. Visoma skrini husoma pamoja na neno linalofafanuliwa.','Show it'=>'Onyesha','Above'=>'Juu','Below'=>'Chini','Word or phrase'=>'Neno au kirai','Apply'=>'Tumia','Profile'=>'Wasifu','Whose profile'=>'Wasifu wa nani','The post’s author'=>'Mwandishi wa chapisho','Show the profile picture'=>'Onyesha picha ya wasifu','Show the biography'=>'Onyesha wasifu','Show links to posts and website'=>'Onyesha viungo vya machapisho na tovuti','Author profile'=>'Wasifu wa mwandishi','Choose whose profile to show.'=>'Chagua wasifu wa kuonyesha.','WhatsApp number, with country code'=>'Nambari ya WhatsApp, pamoja na msimbo wa nchi','For example +44 7700 900123.'=>'Kwa mfano +44 7700 900123.','Message to start with (optional)'=>'Ujumbe wa kuanzia (si lazima)','Show the text next to the icon'=>'Onyesha maandishi karibu na aikoni','Bottom end (right in English)'=>'Mwisho wa chini (kulia kwa Kiingereza)','Bottom start (left in English)'=>'Chini mwanzo (kushoto kwa Kiingereza)','Add your WhatsApp number in the sidebar. Until then the button is not shown on the page.'=>'Ongeza namba yako ya WhatsApp kwenye mwambao wa pembeni. Hadi wakati huo kitufe hakionyeshwi kwenye ukurasa.','On the page, this button floats in a bottom corner of the screen.'=>'Kwenye ukurasa huu, kitufe hiki huelea katika pembe ya chini ya skrini.','Saved to your cloud library.'=>'Imehifadhiwa kwenye maktaba yako ya wingu.','Save to cloud library'=>'Hifadhi kwenye maktaba ya wingu','Save to'=>'Hifadhi hadi','Images are resized, stored once and brought back into the media library of any site that inserts this design.'=>'Picha hubadilishwa ukubwa, huhifadhiwa mara moja na kurudishwa kwenye maktaba ya media ya tovuti yoyote inayoweka muundo huu.','%s style'=>'Mtindo wa %s','Save style to cloud library'=>'Hifadhi mtindo kwenye maktaba ya wingu','Select a block first, then apply the style.'=>'Chagua kizuizi kwanza, kisha utumie mtindo huo.','Library'=>'Maktaba','Save this page to the library'=>'Hifadhi ukurasa huu kwenye maktaba','Insert'=>'Ingiza','Shortcode tag'=>'Lebo ya msimbo mfupi','Use letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Tumia herufi, namba, vistari na mistari ya chini pekee.','Attribute name'=>'Jina la sifa','Add attribute'=>'Ongeza sifa','Shortcode'=>'Nambari fupi','Other attributes'=>'Sifa nyingine','Choose a shortcode tag in the block settings.'=>'Chagua lebo ya msimbo mfupi katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','Image size'=>'Ukubwa wa picha','Thumbnail'=>'Picha ndogo','Full size'=>'Ukubwa kamili','Link to'=>'Unganisha na','Attachment page'=>'Ukurasa wa kiambatisho','Media file'=>'Faili ya media','Audio'=>'Sauti','Video'=>'Video','File address'=>'Anwani ya faili','Poster image'=>'Picha ya bango','Media IDs, separated by commas'=>'Vitambulisho vya Vyombo vya Habari, vikitenganishwa kwa koma','Show the track list'=>'Onyesha orodha ya nyimbo','Embed'=>'Weka','Address to embed'=>'Anwani ya kupachika','Maximum width'=>'Upana wa juu zaidi','Image and caption HTML'=>'HTML ya Picha na maelezo','Tip: the Form block shows this form styled to match your site.'=>'Kidokezo: Kizuizi cha Fomu kinaonyesha fomu hii ikiwa imetengenezwa kwa mtindo unaofanana na tovuti yako.','Show the form title'=>'Onyesha kichwa cha fomu','Show the form description'=>'Onyesha maelezo ya fomu','Submit without reloading the page'=>'Wasilisha bila kupakia upya ukurasa','The "%s" control from the old editor is not available in the block editor. Enter the value as text.'=>'Udhibiti wa "%s" kutoka kwa kihariri cha zamani haupatikani katika kihariri cha vizuizi. Weka thamani kama maandishi.','Choose file'=>'Chagua faili','— Default —'=>'— Chaguomsingi —','Advanced styling'=>'Mtindo wa kina','Inline CSS'=>'CSS ya Ndani','CSS declarations, for example: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333'=>'Matamshi ya CSS, kwa mfano: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333','Effects (legacy classes)'=>'Madhara (madarasa ya urithi)','Space-separated effect names carried over from older versions, for example: hover-shadow'=>'Majina ya athari yaliyotenganishwa na nafasi tupu yaliyohamishwa kutoka matoleo ya zamani, kwa mfano: hover-shadow','Full width, content kept in the middle'=>'Upana wote, maudhui yamewekwa katikati','Link relationship'=>'Uhusiano wa kiungo','Left'=>'Kushoto','Right'=>'Kulia','Add text…'=>'Ongeza maandishi…','Placement'=>'Mahali','On its own line'=>'Katika mstari wake wenyewe','In the line, beside other content'=>'Katika mstari, kando ya maudhui mengine','Automatic (own line at the top level of the page)'=>'Otomatiki (mstari wake wenyewe katika kiwango cha juu cha ukurasa)','Accessible label'=>'Lebo inayoweza kufikiwa','Leave empty for a decorative icon.'=>'Acha wazi kwa ajili ya ikoni ya urembo.','Choose an icon in the block settings.'=>'Chagua aikoni katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','New setting name'=>'Jina jipya la mpangilio','For example: title or text'=>'Kwa mfano: kichwa au maandishi','Add setting'=>'Ongeza mpangilio','Widget'=>'Wijeti','Choose a widget'=>'Chagua wijeti','Widget area'=>'Eneo la wijeti','Choose a widget area'=>'Chagua eneo la wijeti','This image has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Choose it from the Media Library, or set its width and height.'=>'Picha hii haina upana wala urefu, kwa hiyo ukurasa utaruka wakati unapakiwa. Ichague kutoka kwenye Maktaba ya Medya, au uweke upana na urefu wake.','This video is not from the Media Library, so its size is unknown and the page will jump when it loads. Upload it to the Media Library instead.'=>'Video hii haitoki kwenye Maktaba ya Medya, kwa hiyo ukubwa wake haujulikani na ukurasa utaruka inapopakia. Ipakie kwenye Maktaba ya Medya badala yake.','An image, video or frame in this HTML has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Add width and height attributes to it.'=>'Picha, video au fremu katika HTML hii haina upana na urefu, kwa hivyo kurasa itaruka inapopakia. Ongeza sifa za upana na urefu kwake.','This embed resizes itself after it loads, which moves the content below it. Give it room or place it lower on the page.'=>'Kibiriti hiki kinajirekebisha ukubwa baada ya kupakia, jambo ambalo linasogeza maudhui yaliyo chini yake. Ipe nafasi au iweke chini zaidi kwenye ukurasa.','Layout shift'=>'Kuhama kwa mpangilio','This widget does not describe its settings, so they are edited as name and value pairs.'=>'Wijeti hii haielezei mipangilio yake, kwa hivyo inahaririwa kama jozi za jina na thamani.','Problem'=>'Tatizo','Check'=>'Angalia','Show block'=>'Onyesha kizuizi','Use a readable theme colour'=>'Tumia rangi ya mandhari inayosomeka kwa urahisi','Make it H%d'=>'Ifanye iwe H%d','Alt text'=>'Maandishi mbadala','Save alt text'=>'Hifadhi maandishi mbadala','This image is decorative'=>'Picha hii ni ya urembo','Checking…'=>'Inakagua…','No accessibility problems found on this page.'=>'Hakuna matida ya ufikiaji yaliyopatikana kwenye ukurasa huu.','%1$s, %2$s.'=>'%1$s, %2$s.','%d problem'=>'Tatizo %d' . "\0" . '%d matatizo','%d thing to check'=>'kitu %d cha kuangalia' . "\0" . 'Mambo %d ya kuangalia','Check again'=>'Angalia tena','An automatic check finds many problems but not all of them. Also try the page with the keyboard alone and with a screen reader.'=>'Ukaguzi wa kiotomatiki hupata matatizo mengi lakini sio yote. Jaribu pia ukurasa huo kwa kutumia kibodi pekee na kisoma skrini.','Text contrast is %1$s:1; it needs at least %2$s:1 to be readable.'=>'Uwiano wa maandishi ni %1$s:1; unahitaji angalau %2$s:1 ili uweze kusomeka.','click here,here,read more,more,link,this link,learn more,go'=>'bonyeza hapa,hapa,soma zaidi,zaidi,kiungo,kiungo hiki,jifunze zaidi,enda','A link has no text, so a screen reader announces only “link”. Add text or a label.'=>'Kiungo hakina maandishi, kwa hiyo kisoma skrini kinatangaza tu “kiungo”. Ongeza maandishi au lebo.','The link text “%s” does not say where it goes. Describe the destination instead.'=>'Maandishi ya kiungo “%s” hayasemi mahali kinapoelekea. Eleza unakoenda badala yake.','An element has a positive tabindex, which changes the keyboard order away from the reading order. Use 0 or remove it.'=>'Kipengele kina tabindex chanya, ambayo hubadilisha mpangilio wa kibodi mbali na mpangilio wa usomaji. Tumia 0 au kiondoe.','Something clickable cannot be reached with the keyboard. Use a real button or link.'=>'Kitu kinachoweza kubonyewa hakiwezi kufikiwa kwa kibodi. Tumia kitufe au kiungo halisi.','An embedded frame has no title, so a screen reader cannot say what it is.'=>'Fremu iliyopachikwa haina kichwa, kwa hivyo kisoma skrini hakiwezi kusema ni nini.','A form field has no label, so its purpose is not announced.'=>'Sehemu ya fomu haina lebo, kwa hivyo madhumuni yake hayajatangazwa.','This heading is empty. Screen reader users navigate by headings; remove it or add text.'=>'Kichwa hiki cha habari hakina kitu. Watumiaji wa visoma skrini huabiri kupitia vichwa vya habari; kiondoe au ongeza maandishi.','The page title is already the H1; use H2 for the top level of the content.'=>'Kichwa cha ukurasa tayari ni H1; tumia H2 kwa kiwango cha juu cha maudhui.','This H%1$d skips a level; the one before it is H%2$d. Make it an H%3$d.'=>'H%1$d hii inaruka kiwango kimoja; ile iliyotangulia ni H%2$d. Ifanye iwe H%3$d.','This image has no alt text. Describe it, or mark it as decorative if it adds nothing.'=>'Picha hii haina maandishi mbadala. Ifafanue, au iweke alama kuwa ni ya urembo ikiwa haiongezi kitu.','Close panel'=>'Funga kidirisha','Desktop'=>'Kompyuta ya Mezani','Default'=>'Chaguo-msingi','Every track'=>'Kila wimbo','Track sizes, for example: 1fr 2fr 200px'=>'Ukubwa wa nyimbo, kwa mfano: 1fr 2fr 200px','Custom track sizes'=>'Ukubwa maalum wa nyimbo','Equal tracks'=>'Nyimbo sawa','One quoted row per line, for example: "head head" "side main". Name the area on each child block.'=>'Safu moja iliyonukuliwa kwa kila mstari, kwa mfano: "head head" "side main". Taja eneo kwenye kila kizuizi tanzu.','Automatic'=>'Otomatiki','Square (1:1)'=>'Mraba (1:1)','Standard (4:3)'=>'Kiwango (4:3)','Classic (3:2)'=>'Classic (3:2)','Wide (16:9)'=>'Upana (16:9)','Cinema (21:9)'=>'Sinema (21:9)','Tall (9:16)'=>'Ndefu (9:16)','Custom'=>'Maalum','Width / height'=>'Upana / urefu','Background image'=>'Picha ya mandharinyuma','Inherited image — replace'=>'Picha iliyorithiwa — badilisha','Cover'=>'Kava','Contain'=>'Weka ndani','Original size'=>'Ukubwa wa asili','Repeat'=>'Rudia','No repeat'=>'Hakuna marudio','Tile'=>'Kigae','Tile across'=>'Tile kote kote','Tile down'=>'Punguza ukubwa','Fixed while scrolling'=>'Imesitishwa wakati wa kusogeza','Solid'=>'Imara','Dashed'=>'Imevunjwa-vunjwa','Dotted'=>'Yenye nukta','Double'=>'Mara mbili','Each side separately'=>'Kila upande kivyake','Side'=>'Upande','Add a shadow'=>'Ongeza kivuli','Horizontal'=>'Mlalo','Vertical'=>'Wima','Blur'=>'Fificha','Spread'=>'Sambaza','Inside'=>'Ndani','Remove this shadow'=>'Ondoa kivuli hiki','Opacity'=>'Uwazi','Transform'=>'Badilisha','Shadow'=>'Kivuli','Ease'=>'Urahisi','Linear'=>'Mstari','Ease in'=>'Rahisi kuingia','Ease out'=>'Punguza kasi','Ease in and out'=>'Anza na maliza taratibu','Duration (milliseconds)'=>'Muda (milisekunde)','What animates'=>'Kinachohuisha','Easing'=>'Inayolegeza','Delay (milliseconds)'=>'Kuchelewa (milisekunde)','Remove the preset'=>'Ondoa kigezo kilichowekwa awali','More options'=>'Chaguo zaidi','Number and unit'=>'Nambari na kitengo','Custom CSS value (calc, clamp…)'=>'Thamani ya CSS maalum (calc, clamp…)','Set e