ele','Stretch'=>'Panua','Baseline'=>'Misingi','Align self'=>'Jipange mwenyewe','Auto'=>'Otomatiki','Aspect ratio'=>'Uwiano wa kipengele','Background colour'=>'Rangi ya nyuma','Box shadow'=>'Kivuli cha kisanduku','Column span'=>'Safu mlalo','Text colour'=>'Rangi ya maandishi','Cursor'=>'Mshale wa kipanya','Pointer'=>'Kielekezi','Move'=>'Hamisha','Grab'=>'Chukua','Not allowed'=>'Hairuhusiwi','Crosshair'=>'Msalaba','Zoom in'=>'Kuza','Block'=>'Zuia','Inline'=>'Ndani ya ukurasa','Inline block'=>'Bloki ya ndani','Inline flexbox'=>'Flexbox ya ndani','Inline grid'=>'Mtandao wa ndani','Contents only'=>'Yaliyomo pekee','Hidden'=>'Imefichwa','Basis'=>'Msingi','Row reversed'=>'Safu imebadilishwa mpangilio','Column'=>'Safu wima','Column reversed'=>'Safu imerudishwa kinyume','Grow'=>'Ongeza','Shrink'=>'Finya','Wrap'=>'Funga','No wrap'=>'Hakuna ukataji wa maandishi','Wrap reversed'=>'Geuza iliyogeuzwa','Font'=>'Fonti','Italic'=>'Herufi Mjonge','Weight'=>'Uzito','Thin (100)'=>'Nyembamba (100)','Extra light (200)'=>'Nuru ya ziada (200)','Light (300)'=>'Nyepesi (300)','Regular (400)'=>'Kawaida (400)','Medium (500)'=>'Wastani (500)','Semi bold (600)'=>'Semi bold (600)','Bold (700)'=>'Kunenana (700)','Extra bold (800)'=>'Nono la ziada (800)','Black (900)'=>'Nyeusi (900)','Gap'=>'Nafasi','Area name'=>'Jina la eneo','Named areas'=>'Maeneo yenye jina','Offsets'=>'Kodi za Kukabiliana','Justify content'=>'Sawazisha maudhui','Space between'=>'Nafasi kati ya','Space around'=>'Nafasi karibu','Space evenly'=>'Sawazisha nafasi sawia','Letter spacing'=>'Nafasi kati ya herufi','Line height'=>'Urefu wa mstari','Margin'=>'Ukingo','Max height'=>'Urefu wa juu','Max width'=>'Upana wa juu kabisa','Min height'=>'Urefu wa chini kabisa','Min width'=>'Upana wa chini','Overflow'=>'Kufurika','Visible'=>'Inayoonekana','Clip'=>'Nakili','Scroll when needed'=>'Geuza ukitumia ukurasa unapohitajika','Always scroll'=>'Tembea kila wakati','Padding'=>'Nafasi ya ziada','Place items'=>'Weka vipengele','Relative'=>'Husika','Absolute'=>'Kabisa','Fixed'=>'Imesuluhishwa','Corner radius'=>'Kipenyo cha kona','Row span'=>'Upeo wa safu mlalo','Justify'=>'Jaza nafasi','Decoration'=>'Mapambo','Overline'=>'Mstari wa juu','Strikethrough'=>'Kuvusha mstari','Text shadow'=>'Kivuli cha matini','Letter case'=>'Herufi kubwa na ndogo','Uppercase'=>'Herufi kubwa','Lowercase'=>'Herufi ndogo','Capitalise'=>'Weka herufi kubwa','Transition'=>'Badilisha','Stack order (z-index)'=>'Mpangilio wa rundo (z-index)','Add screen sizes of your own, such as a large desktop, a landscape tablet or a small phone.'=>'Ongeza saizi zako za skrini, kama vile kompyuta mpana kubwa, kompyuta kibao ya mlalo au simu ndogo.','Applies'=>'Inatumika','up to a width'=>'hadi upana wa','from a width'=>'kutoka kwa upana','Width (px)'=>'Upana (px)','Remove this breakpoint'=>'Ondoa kituo hiki cha kukomelea','Large desktop'=>'Kompyuta kubwa ya mezani','Add a breakpoint'=>'Ongeza mahali pa kuvunjilia','Radial'=>'Mduara','Conic'=>'Conic','Angle (degrees)'=>'Pembe (digrii)','Ellipse'=>'Mviringo','Colour stop %d'=>'Kituo cha rangi %d','Position (%)'=>'Nafasi (%)','Remove stop'=>'Odoa kituo','Add colour stop'=>'Ongeza kituo cha rangi','Clear gradient'=>'Futa gradienti','Blur behind (px)'=>'Ukungu wa nyuma (px)','Saturation behind (%)'=>'Kiwango cha kujaa nyuma (%)','Tint (use a see-through colour)'=>'Rangi hafifu (tumia rangi ya kuonekana)','Blob'=>'Blob','Hexagon'=>'Hexagon','Triangle'=>'Pembetatu','Diamond'=>'Almasi','Heart'=>'Moyo','Arch'=>'Usanifu','Brush stroke'=>'Kiharusi cha brashi','Mask shape'=>'Umbo la barakoa','Custom image'=>'Picha maalum','Replace mask image'=>'Badilisha picha ya barakoa','Choose mask image'=>'Chagua picha ya kinyago','Fit'=>'Inatosha','Repeat across'=>'Rudia kote','Repeat down'=>'Rudisha chini','Space out'=>'Panga nafasi','Stretch to fit'=>'Nyosha ikutoshee','Multiply'=>'Zidisha','Screen'=>'Skrini','Overlay'=>'Tabaka la juu','Darken'=>'Fanya iwe nyeusi','Lighten'=>'Punguza mwangaza','Colour dodge'=>'Kupunguza mwanga','Colour burn'=>'Kuchoma rangi','Hard light'=>'Nuru kali','Soft light'=>'Nuru hafifu','Difference'=>'Tofauti','Exclusion'=>'Kizuizi','Hue'=>'Rangi','Saturation'=>'Mwisho','Luminosity'=>'Mwangaza','Blend mode'=>'Hali ya mchanganyiko','Blur (px)'=>'Ufifishaji (px)','Brightness (%)'=>'Mwangaza (%)','Contrast (%)'=>'Ulinganifu (%)','Greyscale (%)'=>'Kijivu (%)','Hue rotation (degrees)'=>'Mzunguko wa rangi (digrii)','Saturation (%)'=>'Kujaa (%)','Sepia (%)'=>'Sepia (%)','Drop shadow'=>'Kivuli kinachoanguka','Across (px)'=>'Kote (px)','Down (px)'=>'Chini (px)','Softness (px)'=>'Ulaini (px)','Shadow colour'=>'Rangi ya kivuli','Remove drop shadow'=>'Ondoa kivuli cha tone','Applies on every screen size.'=>'Inatumika kwa kila ukubwa wa skrini.','Applies to the screen size chosen in the design panel.'=>'Inatumika kwa ukubwa wa skrini ulioteuliwa kwenye paneli ya muundo.','Background gradient'=>'Mtindo wa nyuma wa rangi iliyochanganyika','Add gradient'=>'Ongeza rangi ya mtiririko','Glass'=>'Kioo','Mask'=>'Barakoa','Filters'=>'Vichujio','Wave'=>'Wimbi','Waves'=>'Mawimbi','Curve'=>'Mviringo','Curve (asymmetric)'=>'Jongoo (isiyo lingana)','Arc'=>'Safu ya mviringo','Tilt'=>'Tilt','Tilt (layered)'=>'Tilki (iliyowekwa matabaka)','Triangle (asymmetric)'=>'Pembetatu (isiyo na uwiano)','Split'=>'Gawanya','Zigzag'=>'Zigzag','Mountains'=>'Milima','Clouds'=>'Mawingu','Drops'=>'Matone','Pyramids'=>'Pyramids','Book'=>'Weka nafasi','Stairs'=>'Ngazi','Fan'=>'Kipepeo','Height (px)'=>'Urefu (px)','Mirror'=>'Nakili','Invert'=>'Geuza','In front of the content'=>'Mbele ya maudhui','Video file (MP4 / WebM)'=>'Faili ya video (MP4 / WebM)','Choose MP4 or WebM video'=>'Chagua video ya MP4 au WebM','MP4 address'=>'Anwani ya MP4','WebM address'=>'Anwani ya WebM','YouTube video ID (11 characters)'=>'Kitambulisho cha video ya YouTube (wahusika 11)','Vimeo video number'=>'Nambari ya video ya Vimeo','Visitors only contact the video service when they scroll to this section, and never when their device asks for reduced motion. Until then they see the poster image.'=>'Wagenzi huwasiliana tu na huduma ya video wanapotesea hadi sehemu hii, na kamwe wakati kifaa chao kinapoomba mwendo uliopunguzwa. Hadi wakati huo wanaona picha ya bango.','Replace poster image'=>'Badilisha picha ya bango','Choose poster image'=>'Chagua picha ya bango','Background slideshow'=>'Onyesho la slaidi la nyuma','Change images'=>'Badilisha picha','Choose at least two images.'=>'Chagua angalau picha mbili.','Seconds per image'=>'Sekunde kwa kila picha','Slow zoom (Ken Burns)'=>'Kuza polepole (Ken Burns)','Remove slideshow'=>'Ondoa onyesho la slaidi','Visitors who ask their device for reduced motion see the first image only.'=>'Wagenzi wanaouliza vifaa vyao mwendo uliopunguzwa huona picha ya kwanza pekee.','Section effects'=>'Madhhara ya sehemu','Top divider'=>'Kigawanyaji cha juu','Bottom divider'=>'Kigawanyiko cha chini','Choose the logo'=>'Chagua nembo','Not set'=>'Haijawekwa','Check the brand colours: each needs a unique name and a valid colour.'=>'Angalia rangi za chapa: kila moja inahitaji jina la kipekee na rangi halali.','Brand name'=>'Jina la chapa','A logo is chosen.'=>'Nembo imechaguliwa.','Choose the logo from the Site design page.'=>'Chagua nembo kutoka kwenye ukurasa wa Muundo wa tovuti.','Brand colours'=>'Rangi za chapa','Brand %d'=>'Chapa %d','Add brand colour'=>'Ongeza rangi ya chapa','Heading font'=>'Fonti ya kichwa cha habari','Body font'=>'Fonti ya mwili','Tone of voice'=>'Mtindo wa sauti','How your brand writes, e.g. “Friendly and plain, short sentences, no jargon.” The AI follows it whenever it writes for this site.'=>'Jinsi chapa yako inavyoandika, mf. “Rafiki na wazi, sentensi fupi, hakuna msamiati mgumu.” AI hufuata hili wakati wowote inapokiandikia tovuti hii.','Brand kit saved.'=>'Kiti cha chapa kimehifadhiwa.','The brand is applied: its colours, fonts and logo are now the site’s.'=>'Chapa imetumika: rangi zake, fonti na nembo yake sasa ni za tovuti.','Apply to site'=>'Tumia kwenye tovuti','All classes'=>'Madarasa yote','Class name on the page'=>'Jina la darasa kwenye ukurasa','Printed as %s.'=>'Imechapishwa kama %s.','Start with a letter; lowercase letters, digits and hyphens only.'=>'Anza na herufi; herufi ndogo, nambari na vikatishwa pekee.','The style controls are not loaded. Reload the page; if this stays, reinstall the plugin.'=>'Vidhibiti vya mtindo havijapakia. Pakia upya ukurasa; ikiwa hili litaendelea, sakinisha tena programu-jalizi.','Class saved. Every element using it has the new style.'=>'Darasa limehifadhiwa. Kila kipengele kinacholitumia kina mtindo mpya.','Save class'=>'Hifadhi darasa','Class created.'=>'Darasa limeundwa.','New class'=>'Darasa jipya','e.g. Card'=>'k.m. Kadi','Create'=>'Undha','Search classes'=>'Tafuta madarasa','No class matches.'=>'Hakuna darasa linalolingana.','No classes yet. Create one, style it, then add it to any element from its settings.'=>'Hakuna madarasa bado. Unda moja, icheze, kisha uiongeze kwenye kipengele chochote kutoka kwa mipangilio yake.','Edit %s'=>'Hariri %s','Class duplicated.'=>'Daraja limeigwa.','Delete %s'=>'Futa %s','Class deleted.'=>'Darasa limefutwa.','Delete the class "%s"? Elements that use it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'Futa darasa "%s"? Vipengele vinavyoitumית vitaficha maudhui yao na kupoteza mitindo yake.','Only users who may add unfiltered HTML can change custom CSS.'=>'Ni watumiaji pekee wanaoweza kuongeza HTML isiyochujwa ndio wanaoweza kubadilisha CSS maalum.','Some of this CSS will not be used: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" and unbalanced braces are removed for safety.'=>'Baadhi ya CSS hii haitatumika: @import, expression(), URL za javascript:, alama za "<" na mabano yasiyo na uwiano huondolewa kwa ajili ya usalama.','Upload a font'=>'Pakia fonti','Uploading fonts needs WordPress 6.5 or later.'=>'Kupakia fonti kunahitaji WordPress 6.5 au toleo jipya zaidi.','Font name'=>'Jina la fonti','e.g. Brand Sans'=>'mf. Brand Sans','%s is uploaded and ready to use.'=>'%s imepakiwa na iko tayari kutumika.','Choose a font file (%s)'=>'Chagua faili ya fonti (%s)','Font library'=>'Maktaba ya fonti','%d files'=>'faili %d','Font switched off for the site.'=>'Fonti imezimwa kwa tovuti.','Font switched on for the site.'=>'Font imewashwa kwa tovuti.','Switch off'=>'Zima','Switch on'=>'Washa','Adobe Fonts'=>'Adobe Fonts','Paste the kit id of your Adobe Fonts web project. Its fonts are then loaded from Adobe on your pages.'=>'Bandika kit id ya mradi wako wa wavuti wa Adobe Fonts. Fonti zake kisha hupakiwa kutoka Adobe kwenye kurasa zako.','Your web projects'=>'Miradi yako ya mtandao','Adobe Fonts connected.'=>'Adobe Fonts imeunganishwa.','Adobe Fonts disconnected.'=>'Adobe Fonts imetenganishwa.','Kit id'=>'Kit id','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'Thamani ya giza kwa ajili ya "%s" si rangi halali.','When a visitor has not chosen'=>'Wakati mgeni hajachagua','Follow the visitor’s device'=>'Fuata kifaa cha mgeni','Dark colours'=>'Rangi nyeusi','Give each colour its dark version. Colours left empty stay the same in both schemes. Dark mode is on as soon as one colour has a dark value.'=>'Mpe kila rangi toleo lake la gizani. Rangi zilizoachwa wazi zinabaki vilevile katika mifumo yote miwili. Hali ya gizani inawashwa mara tu rangi moja inapokuwa na thamani ya gizani.','Dark version of %s'=>'Toleo la giza la %s','Dark mode saved.'=>'Hali ya giza imehifadhiwa.','Page CSS'=>'CSS ya Ukurasa','Global classes'=>'Madarasa ya kimataifa','Classes'=>'Madarasa','Create classes in Site design, then add them here.'=>'Unda madarasa katika Usanifu wa tovuti, kisha uyaongeze hapa.','Custom CSS'=>'CSS Maalum','Write rules for this element. "selector" means this element, e.g. selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — plain declarations apply to the element itself.'=>'Andika sheria kwa kipengele hiki. "selector" inamaanisha kipengele hiki, kwa mfano selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — matangazo ya kawaida yanatumika kwa kipengele chenyewe.','Font files must be %s.'=>'Faili za fonti lazima ziwe %s.','That font file is empty or larger than 10 MB.'=>'Faili hiyo ya fonti haina kitu au ni kubwa zaidi ya MB 10.','Style once, reuse everywhere, change in one place.'=>'Mtindo mara moja, tumia tena kila mahali, badilisha mahali pamoja.','Variables'=>'Vigezo','Named values any element can use.'=>'Maadili yaliyopewa majina ambayo kipengele chochote kinaweza kutumia.','Spacing, radius and shadows'=>'Nafasi, ncha na vivuli','The scales every spacing, corner and shadow picker offers.'=>'Vipimo ambavyo kila kiteuzi cha nafasi, pembe na kivuli kinatoa.','A dark version of your colours, for visitors who want it.'=>'Toleo la rangi zako za giza, kwa wageni wanaolitaka.','Logo, colours, fonts and tone of voice, used by the AI and templates.'=>'Nembo, rangi, fonti na mtindo wa sauti, vinavyotumiwa na AI na templeti.','Upload your own fonts or connect Adobe Fonts.'=>'Pakia fonti zako au unganisha Adobe Fonts.','CSS for this page only.'=>'CSS kwa ukurasa huu pekee.','CSS for this page'=>'CSS ya ukurasa huu','Loaded only on this page, after the site’s styles. Saved with the page.'=>'Imepakiwa kwenye ukurasa huu tu, baada ya mitindo ya tovuti. Imehifadhiwa pamoja na ukurasa.','Short name'=>'Jina fupi','The short name "%s" is used twice.'=>'Jina fupi "%s" linatumika mara mbili.','"%s": short names use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s": majina mafupi hutumia herufi ndogo, namba na vistari.','The value of "%s" is not one this setting accepts.'=>'Thamani ya "%s" sio inayokubaliwa na mpangilio huu.','Radius'=>'Radius','Add a step'=>'Ongeza hatua','Scales saved.'=>'Vipimo vimehifadhiwa.','Scales are back to the defaults.'=>'Vipimo vimerejeshwa kwenye viwango vya msingi.','Reset to the default scales'=>'Weka upya kwa mizani chaguomsingi','No variables yet. A variable holds one value — a width, a colour mix, a font size — that many elements share.'=>'Hakuna vigezo bado. Kigezo hushikilia thamani moja — upana, mchanganyiko wa rangi, au ukubwa wa fonti — ambayo vipengele vingi vinashiriki.','Add variable'=>'Ongeza kigezo','Variables saved.'=>'Vigezo vimehifadhiwa.','Entrance animation'=>'Uhuishaji wa kuingia','Fade in'=>'Fifisha taratibu','Fade in, rising'=>'Fifika, inayoinuka','Fade in, dropping'=>'Inapotea, inashuka','Fade in from the start side'=>'Fifisha kutoka upande wa kwanza','Fade in from the end side'=>'Fifia kutoka upande wa mwisho','Zoom out'=>'Vuta nje','Flip up'=>'Geuza juu','Animation length (ms)'=>'Muda wa uhuishaji (ms)','Animation delay (ms)'=>'Kuchelewa kwa uhuishaji (ms)','While scrolling'=>'Wakati wa kusogeza','Fade in as it scrolls into view'=>'Ififike inapनवीनza kusogeza','Rise as it scrolls into view'=>'Inuka inaposogea kwenye mtazamo','Grow as it scrolls into view'=>'Kua inavyotokea wakati wa kusogeza','Straighten as it scrolls into view'=>'Nyosha kadiri inavyoonekana kwenye skrini','On hover'=>'Ukielea kipanya','Lift'=>'Badilisha kiwango','Glow'=>'Mwanga','Stay in view (px from the top)'=>'Baki kwenye mwonekano (px kutoka juu)','Parallax speed (-10 to 10)'=>'Kasi ya paralaksi (-10 hadi 10)','Follow the pointer (strength)'=>'Fuata kielekezi (nguvu)','Place ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha Mahali','Find it with Google’s Place ID finder: search for your business and copy the ID.'=>'Ipate kwa kutumia kitafutaji cha Place ID cha Google: tafuta biashara yako na ukili kopi namba ya utambulisho (ID).','An API key from your Google Cloud project with the Places API (New) enabled. Restrict it to that API.'=>'Ufunguo wa API kutoka kwa mradi wako wa Google Cloud ukiwa na Places API (New) umewashwa. Uzuie kwa API hiyo.','Business unit ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha kitengo cha biashara','The 24-character ID of your business on Trustpilot, from your Trustpilot Business account (Integrations › API).'=>'Kitambulisho cha herufi 24 cha biashara yako kwenye Trustpilot, kutoka kwa akaunti yako ya Trustpilot Business (Integrations › API).','The API key of your Trustpilot Business account.'=>'Ufunguo wa API wa akaunti yako ya Trustpilot Business.','Not set up.'=>'Haijasanidiwa.','The saved key can no longer be read (the site’s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ufunguo uliOhifadhiwa hauwezi kusomwa tena (funguo za usalama za tovuti zilibadilika). Ingiza tena.','Needs both an ID and an API key.'=>'Inahitaji kitambulisho na ufunguo wa API.','Set up. Google reviews are loaded live each time a page with a Reviews block is viewed: one Place Details request on your own key per view, never stored (Google’s terms do not allow keeping them).'=>'Weka mapendeleo. Hakiki za Google zinapakiwa moja kwa moja kila wakati ukurasa wenye kizuizi cha Hakiki unapotazamwa: ombi moja la Maelezo ya Mahali kwenye ufunguo wako mwenyewe kwa kila mtazamo, halihifadhiwi kamwe (masharti ya Google hayaruhusu kuzihifadhi).','The first refresh failed: %s'=>'Onyesho jipya la kwanza limeshindwa: %s','Waiting for the first refresh (within a minute or two).'=>'Inasubiri kuonyeshwa upya kwa mara ya kwanza (ndani ya dakika moja au mbili).','Refreshed %1$s: %2$d reviews kept, rated %3$s from %4$d.'=>'Imesasishwa %1$s: Maoni %2$d yamehifadhiwa, yametolewa alama ya %3$s kutoka kwa %4$d.','The last try, %1$s, failed and the reviews above were kept: %2$s'=>'Jaribio la mwisho, %1$s, limeshindwa na hakiki zilizo hapo juu zimehifadhiwa: %2$s','Saved. Trustpilot reviews are fetched in the background within a minute or two; Google reviews load live on the page.'=>'Imetunzwa. Mapitio ya Trustpilot yanachukuliwa kwa nyuma ndani ya dakika moja au mbili; hakiki za Google zinapakiwa moja kwa moja kwenye ukurasa.','Trustpilot reviews are fetched once a day in the background and kept on your site, so a busy page costs nothing extra on your Trustpilot account; if a refresh fails, the last reviews stay. Google does not allow its reviews to be stored, so they are loaded live when a visitor views the page: each view is one request on your own Google key, billed by Google.'=>'Hakiki za Trustpilot zinachukuliwa mara moja kwa siku nyuma ya pazia na kuwekwa kwenye tovuti yako, kwa hivyo ukurasa wenye shughuli nyingi haugharimu chochote cha ziada kwenye akaunti yako ya Trustpilot; ikiماسafishaji kikishindwa, hakiki za mwisho zinabaki. Google hairuhusu hakiki zake kuhifadhiwa, kwa hivyo zinapakiwa moja kwa moja wakati mgeni anapotazama ukurasa: kila mtazamo ni ombi moja kwenye ufunguo wako wa Google, linalotozwa na Google.','Where to find it'=>'Mahali pa kuipata','Saved (…%s). Type a new one to replace it.'=>'Imes محفوظة (%s). Andika mpya ili kuichukua nafasi yake.','Remove the %s details and its reviews'=>'Ondoa maelezo ya %s na hakiki zake','Refreshed.'=>'Imesasishwa.','Refresh now'=>'Osha sasa','Next daily refresh: %s.'=>'Sasisho linalofuata la kila siku: %s.','Your Google and Trustpilot details, for the Reviews block.'=>'Maelezo yako ya Google na Trustpilot, kwa ajili ya kizuizi cha Uhakiki.','No colours yet.'=>'Hakuna rangi bado.','Colour %d'=>'Rangi %d','Add colour'=>'Ongeza rangi','Two colours have the same name. Rename one.'=>'Rangi mbili zina jina moja. Badilisha jina la moja wapo.','"%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'"%s" si rangi halali.','Theme colours'=>'Rangi za mandhari','Your theme’s palette. A change here is saved as your site’s version of the colour, the same way the Site Editor saves it, and applies everywhere the colour is used.'=>'Mandhari ya rangi yako. Mabadiliko hapa yanahifadhiwa kama toleo la tovuti yako la rangi hiyo, kwa njia sawa na inavyohifadhiwa na Kihariri cha Tovuti, na yanatumika kila mahali rangi hiyo inapotumika.','Theme colours are back to the theme’s own values.'=>'Rangi za mandhari zimerejeshwa kwenye thamani asili za mandhari hiyo.','Reset theme colours'=>'Weka upya rangi za mandhari','Your colours'=>'Rangi zako','Colours saved.'=>'Rangi zimehifadhiwa.','Pick a colour for %s'=>'Chagua rangi kwa ajili ya %s','Clear'=>'Futa','The change could not be saved.'=>'Mabadiliko hayakuweza kuhifadhiwa.','Theme default'=>'Mandhari chaguomsingi','Theme fonts'=>'Fonti za Mandhari','Your fonts'=>'Font zako','Font stack'=>'Mtindo wa fonti','Uploaded font: its files come from the font library.'=>'Font iliyopakia: faili zake zinatoka kwenye maktaba ya fonti.','System sans-serif'=>'Mfumo wa sans-serif','Add font stack'=>'Ongeza safu ya fonti','Fonts saved.'=>'Fonti zimehifadhiwa.','Shared with your theme and the Site Editor.'=>'Imeshirikiwa na mandhari yako na Kihariri cha Tovuti.','Fonts'=>'Fonti','Heading and body fonts for the whole site.'=>'Fonti za kichwa na za mwili kwa tovuti nzima.','Back to Site design'=>'Rudi kwenye Muundo wa Tovuti','Classes, tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts come with Pro'=>'Madarasa, alama, hali ya giza, kifaa cha chapa na fonti maalum huja na Pro','Open the Site Editor’s styles'=>'Fungua mitindo ya Kihariri cha Tovuti','A heading with a tighter line height, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Kichwa cha habari chenye urefu mdogo wa mstari, kilichopambwa kwa kutumia kichupo cha Mtindo.','A paragraph of text, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Aya ya maandishi, iliyopambwa kwa kichupo cha Mtindo.','An image with rounded corners, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Picha yenye pembe za mviringo, iliyopambwa kwa kutumia kichupo cha Mtindo.','A video from the Media Library, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Video kutoka Maktaba ya Midia, iliyopambwa kwa kichupo cha Mtindo.','Spacer'=>'Nafasi ya Kuacha','Empty space between blocks; set a different height per screen size in the Style tab.'=>'Nafasi tupu kati ya vizuizi; weka urefu tofauti kwa kila ukubwa wa skrini katika kichupo cha Mtindo.','Divider'=>'Kibaguzi','A horizontal line between sections, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Mstari wa mlalo kati ya sehemu, uliopambwa kwa kichupo cha Mtindo.','Content from another site (a video, a post, a map) by pasting its address.'=>'Maudhui kutoka tovuti nyingine (video, chapisho, ramani) kwa kubandika anwani yake.','Several images in a grid, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Picha kadhaa kwenye gridi, zilizopambwa kwa kichupo cha Mtindo.','Plain'=>'Wazi','No languages to switch between. The switcher appears when a translation plugin lists two or more languages.'=>'Hakuna lugha za kubadilisha kati yake. Kitufe cha kubadilisha huonekana wakati plagi ya utafsiri inaorodhesha lugha mbili au zaidi.','Switcher'=>'Kibadilishaji','Show the current language'=>'Onyesha lugha ya sasa','Install Tranzly and list two or more languages, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Weka Tranzly na uorodheshe lugha mbili au zaidi, kisha kibadilishaji lugha kitaonekana hapa.','Pills'=>'Vidonge','Dropdown'=>'Menyu ya kuteremka','Language codes'=>'Misimbo ya lugha','Show each language as'=>'Onyesha kila lugha kama','Language name'=>'Jina la lugha','Language code'=>'Msimbo wa lugha','Name and code'=>'Jina na msimbo','Flags'=>'Bendera','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'Imezimwa kwa chaguo-msingi: bendera ni nchi, sio lugha.','Include the current language'=>'Jumuisha lugha ya sasa','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Ficha lugha ambazo ukurasa huu haujatafsiriwa kwazo','Stack vertically'=>'Panga wima','Current language text'=>'Lugha ya sasa','Current language background'=>'Asili ya lugha ya sasa','Size and spacing'=>'Ukubwa na nafasi','Space between languages'=>'Nafasi kati ya lugha','Text size'=>'Ukubwa wa maandishi','Connected (key %s).'=>'Imeunganishwa (ufunguo %s).','API URL'=>'URL ya API','Replace the API key'=>'Badili ufunguo wa API','Where to find your %s API key'=>'Mahali pa kupata ufunguo wako wa API wa %s','Check and save'=>'Angalia na uhifadhi','Connect a mailing-list service once; then any form can add the people who fill it in to one of your lists (the form block\'s settings → After sending). Keys are checked with the service, stored encrypted on this site and never shown again.'=>'Unganisha huduma ya orodha ya barua pepe mara moja; kisha fomu yoyote inaweza kuongeza watu wanaojaza fomu hiyo kwenye moja ya orodha zako (mipangilio ya kizuizi cha fomu → Baada ya kutuma). Funguo zinathibitishwa na huduma, zinahifadhiwa kwa njia fiche kwenye tovuti hii na hazionyeshwi tena.','Send form submissions and button clicks to your analytics with no code. Leave an ID empty to skip that service. Buttons get a "Conversion event" field in their Advanced panel. With the cookie banner on, nothing loads until the visitor agrees.'=>'Tuma mawasilisho ya fomu na mibofyo ya vitufe kwenye uchanganuzi wako bila msimbo. Acha kitambulisho kikiwa wazi ili kuruka huduma hiyo. Vitufe vinapata uwanja wa "Tukio la ubadilishaji" kwenye kidirisha chao cha Juu. Ikiwa bendera ya kuki imewashwa, hakuna kinachopakiwa hadi mgeni akubaliane.','Google Analytics 4 measurement ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha kipimo cha Google Analytics 4','Google Tag Manager container ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha kontena la Google Tag Manager','Meta Pixel ID (the number shown in Meta Events Manager)'=>'Kitambulisho cha Meta Pixel (nambari inayoonyeshwa katika Meta Events Manager)','Load these tags on my site'=>'Pakia lebo hizi kwenye tovuti yangu','Switch off if your theme or another plugin already adds them; events are still sent.'=>'Zima ikiwa mandhari yako au programu-jalizi nyingine tayari imeongeza; matukio bado yanatumwa.','Event name for form submissions'=>'Jina la tukio kwa ajili ya kuwasilisha fomu','The banner is a popup you design with blocks. Its buttons link to #consent-accept, #consent-reject and #consent-save (with tick boxes named analytics and marketing for "save"); a link to #consent-open anywhere shows it again. Until a visitor accepts, tracking tags do not load, Google Consent Mode stays "denied", and the scripts you list stay switched off.'=>'Bendera ni ibukizi unayounda kwa kutumia vizuizi. Vifungo vyake vinaunganisha na #consent-accept, #consent-reject na #consent-save (pamoja na visanduku vya kuteua vinavyoitwa analytics na marketing kwa ajili ya "save"); kiungo cha kwenda #consent-open popote kinakionyesha tena. Hadi mgeni akubali, lebo za ufuatiliaji hazipakii, Hali ya Idhini ya Google (Google Consent Mode) inabaki "denied", na hati unazorodhesha zinabaki zimezimwa.','Create a ready-made banner'=>'Tengeneza bango lililotengenezwa tayari','Show a cookie banner'=>'Onyesha bango la vidakuzi','Banner'=>'Bango','Choose a popup…'=>'Chagua dirisha ibukizi…','%s (draft)'=>'%s (rasimu)','Edit the banner'=>'Hariri bango','Remember the choice for (days)'=>'Kumbuka chaguo kwa (days)','Outside the European Union, the EEA and the UK: load tracking until the visitor says no'=>'Nje ya Umoja wa Ulaya, EAA na Uingereza: pakia ufuatiliaji hadi mgeni atakaposema hapana','Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor\'s country (for example Cloudflare\'s CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.'=>'Imezimwa: kila mgeni lazima akubaliane kwanza (kanuni kali zaidi, na chaguo-msingi). Imewashwa: wakati tu mwenyeji wako au CDN inapyoripoti nchi ya mgeni (kwa mfano kichwa cha CF-IPCountry cha Cloudflare) na iko nje ya EU, EEA, UK na Uswisi. Bango bado linaonyeshwa, na nchi isiyojulikana inachukuliwa kuwa iko ndani ya EU.','Other scripts to hold until consent (handle:analytics or handle:marketing, comma separated)'=>'Hatiandishi zingine za kushikilia hadi idhini itolewe (kitambulisho:analytics au kitambulisho:marketing, zimetenganishwa na koma)','Popups, slide-ins and bars'=>'Madirishaibukizi, vidirisha na mabaraza','A/B test results'=>'Matokeo ya mtihani wa A/B','Guides: forms, popups, motion, tracking, A/B tests and the cookie banner'=>'Miongozo: fomu, popups, mwendo, ufuatiliaji, majaribio ya A/B na bendera ya vidakuzi','Mailing-list connections'=>'Miunganisho ya orodha ya barua pepe','Popup settings'=>'Mipangilio ya ibukizi','Popup (in the middle, page dimmed)'=>'Dirisha ibukizi (katikati, ukurasa umefifia)','Slide-in (in a corner)'=>'Teleza ndani (kwenye kona)',